WEBVTT

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.560
The tea stalk is standing up.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.270
Did you know this English saying:

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.280
"If the tea stalk is standing, a great guest shall arrive."

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:19.740
Forgive me, but they're already here...

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:21.860
Regardless of whether they're "great" or not...

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.340
Good job!

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.540
Charge!

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:53.390
Ooarai Girls High School Victory Exhibition Match

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:52.920
Be careful!

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:09.300
This exhibition match feels so cool!

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:10.720
"Cool"...

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.920
Is that important in Senshado?

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:18.090
Eh? Then why did you take up Senshado, Mika?

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:23.380
The most important lessons in life are all condensed into Senshado.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.680
But most people don't realize that.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.900
What do you mean?

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:40.920
Even though it's a friendly, isn't this too careless?

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:45.160
We can't break this encirclement apart as easily as a scone.

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:46.600
Calm down.

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:49.020
"Be elegant at all times."

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:52.420
This is St. Gloriana's way of Senshado!

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.420
Looks like they aren't returning fire.

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:59.800
It's like they're taking their time...

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.540
I'm sure they're drinking black tea in there!

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:04.020
Shall we have some green tea then?

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.580
I want a milkshake!

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:08.760
There are eggs and milk in the cooler.

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:10.050
Milkshakes are no problem!

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:11.680
That's great!

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:13.940
So, what should we do, Miporin?

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:16.500
Please stop firing.

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:20.400
It will take some time for their detached force to arrive.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:24.700
Use this time to move forward slowly, and make the encirclement tighter.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:29.700
Get into a safe position and destroy the enemy at close range.

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.080
Understood!

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.240
Time is on our side, so please move carefully.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:34.940
Panzer vor!

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:48.820
Um...

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:53.120
Commander Nishizumi, what does "Panzer vor" mean?

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:56.380
Oh, it means "tanks, move forward"!

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:59.740
I see! That's what it means! A lesson learned!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.820
What's up with Chihatan High School?

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.580
Feels a bit weird.

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:06.560
But everyone looks really passionate and brave.

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.220
Tanks, forward!

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:09.360
Tanks, forward!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.120
Tanks, forward!

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:10.980
Tanks, forward!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.240
Tanks, forward!

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:16.740
Then, once again...

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.900
Panzer vor!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.180
All tanks, halt!

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:23.020
Duck team, ready to fire!

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:24.840
Rabbit team is also ready!

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.440
No problems here, nyaa~

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:27.760
Ready to fire!

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:29.290
We can start anytime!

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:33.010
The Oarai-Chihatan offensive deployment is complete.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:35.060
How is the defensive team?

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:37.790
They're moving up slowly...

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:39.500
We have about five minutes.

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:41.100
She said we have five minutes.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:44.380
But I don't think we can last that long.

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:45.090
Understood.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:47.460
Begin firing!

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:11.260
Chihatan tank number 2 got a Matilda II!

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.220
We got a St. Gloriana tank!

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.140
It's a feat!

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:16.480
Incredible!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.820
It's the first St. Gloriana tank we've knocked out since an M3 Stuart!

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:20.870
Nishi-dono, we just need to charge!

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:23.330
That's right, charging is our school's tradition!

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:25.160
There's naught to do but charge now!

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:26.540
Well, how should I put it...

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:27.540
Charge!

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:28.280
Charge!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.260
We'll charge directly in even if it means our deaths!

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:32.250
Wait, wait! We can't lose our formation!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.190
We need to show the world the spirit of Chihatan!

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:35.820
Victory is ours!

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:36.760
Well, then...

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:38.170
All right, charge!

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.540
Um, Nishi-san...

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:14.730
The scone broke apart by itself.

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:17.360
We just need to enjoy the taste now.

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:25.510
The sandwich is about to be done, too.

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.160
Fire.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.540
Damn!

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:41.790
We almost made it...

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.520
Should we really be doing this?

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:45.770
No, no way...

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:46.930
No, it's good!

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:49.580
Oh, no! If this keeps up...

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:53.120
Our Chihantan First Company seems to have charged!

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:54.840
Okay, we can't lag behind!

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:55.600
We gotta take them!

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.550
Charge!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:57.660
Yes!

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.160
Um, wait...

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:01.780
Senpai-dono!

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:04.760
We will follow your lead! Tank, forward!

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:08.560
This is why we stopped you; you're all too impulsive!

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:09.660
Please let us go!

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:11.750
We can't face our comrades if we don't go!

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:13.540
An aggressive attack is good, but

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.840
It's not good if you die in the middle of the match!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.340
But we Chihatan...!

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:20.500
Didn't Commander Nishizumi tell us to hold this position?

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:22.590
An order is the same as a rule!

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:23.900
But...!

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:25.650
Rules are to be followed!

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.300
Our defense will be broken here!

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:29.720
Retreat and regroup!

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:31.090
Okay, let's go!

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:32.770
What are you doing?!

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.050
All right, all right!

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:42.360
Kept you waiting, huh?

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.190
I've waited so long, my black tea has already gone cold.

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:46.780
I can't help it!

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:49.330
I thought it'd be easier to break through!

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:51.200
We could have just gone around it.

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:54.280
Anyway, can you flank the enemy as soon as possible?

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:55.450
Leave it to me!

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:58.190
Once Katyusha arrives, everything will be over!

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:00.200
All tanks, take aim at the enemy's flag tank!

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:03.380
То есть, исход битвы решится на этом поле для гольфа?
To yest', iskhod bitvy reshitsya na etom pole dlya gol'fa?

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:03.380
So we're fighting a decisive battle on this golf course?

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:05.970
да, хорошо если всё получится
Da, khorosho yesli vso poluchitsya

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:05.970
Yes, if everything turns out well.

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:09.040
Nonna, Klara, speak in Japanese!

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:10.100
что?
Chto?

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:10.100
What?

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:11.770
We have 1.4 times more tanks than the enemy.

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:14.730
Firepower 1.95 times. We have a definite advantage!

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:17.270
Our help is arriving soon.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.550
It's your turn, Katyusha.

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:22.040
Don't steal my lines! I'm the one giving orders!

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:27.370
They're on the move!

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:28.620
Don't let them regroup!

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:29.340
Get them!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.170
What is that?

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:35.580
Looks like a crab!

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.220
It's the Crusader cruiser tank!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.860
It's quick, so pay attention!

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:40.000
Cease fire!

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:46.960
We're being flanked.

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:50.430
It's no good!

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:51.850
I'd rather just take them head on!

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:53.340
That's the spirit of Chihatan!

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.160
Calm down!

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:56.460
Commander Nishizumi, what do you think?

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:57.950
Fighting here is disadvantageous to us!

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:58.880
Pull back!

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:01.120
You want us to show our backs to the enemy?

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:03.060
I'm not pulling back!

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:03.960
That was an order!

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:05.490
We will fight back!

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:06.480
We're going downhill!

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:09.660
Once we're downhill, try and split up their forces!

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:10.340
Yes!

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:11.780
Understood!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.710
Argh, they missed such a chance...

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.420
What on earth are they doing?

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:18.550
Because humans are fallible creatures.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:21.660
What's important is that we learn from those mistakes.

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:39.780
Here, here!

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:57.630
Taste my 57mm volley spike!

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:58.830
Take this!

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:03.500
Huh?

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:08.260
I can't say the same for Kuromorimine,

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:09.720
but I'm not going to fall for that!

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:21.300
They're fast. They'll surround us.

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:22.890
Mallard team, go up front!

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:24.690
Just charge towards the enemy.

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:26.280
You're heavier, so you'll be fine.

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:26.760
All right!

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:28.170
Hippo team, please follow them!

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:29.160
Got it!

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:43.540
Don't let them provoke you!

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.540
Just chase after their flag tank!

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:48.440
Looks like our diversion tactics didn't work

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:49.050
Yeah...

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:52.100
Do you want to try fighting the enemy flag tank again?

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.760
Lots of enemy tanks around her, too dangerous.

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:56.960
Mako-san, make it look like our tank is trying to run away but failing.

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:57.870
Understood.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:24.420
Rabbit team here.

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:26.590
Can you let us engage the enemy's rear?

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:28.370
I'll leave it to you! Be careful!

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:29.380
Yes!

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:31.220
Heavy tank killer, coming up!

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:32.280
Do your best, Karina!

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:33.410
Let's go!

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:34.720
Okay, let's go!

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:35.820
The same old "Let's

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:36.440
Go!"

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:40.600
Fire at us if you can!

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:41.380
Don't underestimate Oarai!

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:42.320
Don't underestimate us!

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:45.520
They're really strong!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:46.940
It's all right!

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:48.940
They definitely can't shoot like this!

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:52.580
Stop! Stop!

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:53.620
Um...

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:54.820
Forward, forward!

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:56.140
Stick close to them!

00:12:58.280 --> 00:12:59.410
Bastard!

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:00.700
Didn't expect that!

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:01.760
What to do? What to do?

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:03.540
What do we do?

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.680
If this goes on...

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.440
Saki looks like she has something to say!

00:13:13.510 --> 00:13:14.220
Butterfly.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.950
You're falling behind! Nonna, what's up?

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:24.230
It's nothing

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:27.140
We are gonna pass through point OY12.

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:28.900
- Sic est!
- Got it!
- Alles klar!

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:30.700
Sorry for the wait.

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:39.340
Fire!

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.180
A hit!

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:00.860
Our first knockout in an official match!

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:02.200
We're becoming stronger!

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:04.480
When will the charge begin?

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.860
Then, Katyusha, what is your plan?

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.220
Don't just use my name like that!

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:10.020
We're charging forward, of course!

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:13.320
We'll take these little guys and peel them off bit by bit,

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:15.880
and make them into side dishes for our pirozhki!

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:19.820
Может ли быть такое, что четыреый зайдет на Черчилль через назад?
Mozhet li byt' takoye, chto chetyreyy zaydet na Cherchill' cherez nazad?

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:19.820
Could it be that the Pz IV will go behind the Churchill and attack?

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:23.620
Думаю, да. Михо на такое способна, Клара 
Dumayu, da. Mikho na takoye sposobna, Klara

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:23.620
Miho-san might do that, Klara.

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:26.520
I'm telling you guys, speak in Japanese!

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:27.780
Nonna, take the lead!

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:28.180
Yes!

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.380
Прикрой флаг, пожалуйста!
Prikroy flag, pozhaluysta!

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.380
Protect the flag tank. please!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:31.130
Поняла!
Ponyala!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:31.130
Understood!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:35.600
Rosehip, the Pz IV is aiming for me.

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:38.260
Take that into consideration and make precise movements.

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:40.660
Don't obsess yourself with speed.

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:42.340
Of course!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:52.040
They're here again...

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.660
Found them! I'm gonna destroy you!

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:08.020
Don't push yourselves, guys!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:09.640
Prez, you should push yourself!

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:12.780
They're lining up!

00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:14.380
Pull back one block!

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:27.740
Where are our leading troops?

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:30.260
Darjeeling-sama's black tea is going cold!

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:39.620
For real?

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:41.260
Vanilla, fall back!

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:43.320
Cranberry, chase after them with me!

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:44.760
Make way! Excuse me!

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:05.580
It's about time to fall back!

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.160
Understood!

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.780
Oh, it's broken...

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:12.280
I'm sorry, I didn't catch that

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.440
We're retreating!

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:14.000
Yes?

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:15.180
Retreating!

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:17.340
Re-treat-ing!

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:18.920
"We-are-charging"...

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:20.920
Understood!

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:23.540
What?

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:26.450
Eh?

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:27.380
What?

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:28.420
Charge!

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:34.500
It hurts!

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:36.960
Sorry! I am not a capable soldier!

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:37.820
They're coming!

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:38.980
Run!

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:40.970
Commander Nishi! How dare you...!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:41.560
Stop!

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:43.300
Please don't stop me!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.680
If this continues, it will just be shameful!

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:48.880
It'll be shameful if we're defeated after going so far!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:51.240
Just pay them back properly later.

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:05.080
You can't run away from the top speedster of St. Gloriana!

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:08.740
Fire!

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:09.340
Stop!

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:20.680
Yes! There's just one left!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.590
Leopon here!

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:23.590
The OY line was broken!

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:26.240
We also got knocked out, sorry!

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:38.860
Ohohohoho! It's a turnaround!

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:41.300
Found you!

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:42.420
Please turn left!

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:00.670
Я не дам тебе уйти!
Ya ne dam tebe uyti!

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:00.670
I'm not letting you run!

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:42.760
Yes!

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:43.840
It's your house again?

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.670
Why is it always your house? I'm so jealous!

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:50.640
Time to bring this to an end!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.940
Duck-dono, what do we do?

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:21.420
It's dangerous out here in the open! If that's the case—

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:24.420
Damn, we had an advantage in numbers!

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:26.940
Fixed turrets don't do any good in chases!

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:27.760
Okay, time for Hina-chan—

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.800
No, that thing from Carpaccio's battle!

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.460
"CV-33 Turn"! Other name: "Napoli-turn"!

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:33.440
Go, Oryou!

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:34.140
Got it!

00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:39.060
Not from the side!

00:19:57.620 --> 00:20:01.240
Mako, feint going to the right, then go into the left road.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.400
Got it!

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.220
Hi, everyone!

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:13.580
You sly dogs! This is a no-fire zone!

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:15.000
We know!

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:39.140
Duck-dono, what next?

00:20:39.140 --> 00:20:42.040
Maybe a quick attack, just stick close to me

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.880
Understood, Duck-dono!

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:46.440
Getting called "Duck-dono" doesn't feel right...

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:49.700
Anteater team about to arrive!

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:51.120
We are ready!

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:52.640
We're doing this again?

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:53.880
It's good to take it easy!

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:55.940
Perform "Super Morals Committee Attack"!

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:56.500
Yes!

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:58.940
Keep it steady, not yet...

00:20:59.420 --> 00:20:59.920
Fire!

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:04.760
Good job, baby!

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:14.560
Drive down here.

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:15.080
'Aight.

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:16.340
Is this all right?

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:17.740
Mako-san can do it.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.220
Are they stupid?

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:26.860
Miho-sha is being reckless again!

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:28.460
Do we go back and go around?

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:30.360
Of course we push forward!

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:33.800
If Miho-sha's tank could do it, Katyusha can, too!

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:34.500
I understand.

00:22:03.080 --> 00:22:04.840
Idiot! I won't fall for it again!

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:11.640
Yes!

00:22:11.900 --> 00:22:13.140
Beautiful!

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:18.320
Can't see clearly.

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:20.080
I wish we had a side under mirror!

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:22.520
Hey, we found their flag tank!

00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:24.480
She's drinking tea leisurely out here.

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:26.380
Understood, we'll regroup at your position.

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:32.160
Darjeeling, lead them to our trusty ally!

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:33.200
Understood.

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:34.380
Can we trust them?

00:23:06.220 --> 00:23:08.230
Don't worry, pay attention to its turret!

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:17.500
Take this!

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:18.180
Take this!

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:27.220
Hurry up and load!

00:23:27.220 --> 00:23:29.460
Understood, loading complete!

00:23:29.600 --> 00:23:30.700
Turn the turret!

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:32.580
It's turning so slowly!

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:33.760
Hurry, hurry!

00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:38.440
Ara, ara...

00:23:38.460 --> 00:23:41.620
KV-2 will flip over if it turns at that angle!

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:42.260
Get inside!

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:53.080
Just aim at their flag tank!

00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:00.600
My first kill...

00:24:06.180 --> 00:24:08.060
Do your best! Do it for us too!

00:24:08.060 --> 00:24:09.460
Kawashima-senpai! Good luck!

00:24:09.460 --> 00:24:11.000
- Kill them!
- Good luck!
- Hit!

00:24:17.820 --> 00:24:18.440
Look out!

00:24:30.700 --> 00:24:32.760
Looks like the battle is decided!

00:24:33.380 --> 00:24:36.820
How about it? If you apologize, I'll let you go!

00:24:54.160 --> 00:24:56.180
Please stick close to the Churchill.

00:24:56.540 --> 00:24:58.240
It's safer that way!

00:25:08.520 --> 00:25:10.480
The real fighter is here!

00:25:10.660 --> 00:25:11.960
My first kill...

00:25:12.400 --> 00:25:13.220
Fire!

00:25:17.800 --> 00:25:19.760
Katyusha, can I leave it to you?

00:25:19.860 --> 00:25:21.040
I've got no choice, I guess...

00:25:28.080 --> 00:25:29.200
<b>AQUA WORLD   IBARAKI PREFECTURE OARAI AQUARIUM</b>

00:25:34.100 --> 00:25:34.660
Next shot!

00:25:40.420 --> 00:25:43.200
The flag tank of Oarai-Chihatan is knocked out!

00:25:43.640 --> 00:25:47.760
The victory goes to St. Gloriana-Pravda!

00:25:50.120 --> 00:25:51.840
Oh, they lost...

00:25:52.000 --> 00:25:52.840
Seems so.

00:25:53.070 --> 00:25:55.490
We should have joined the match.

00:25:55.870 --> 00:25:57.250
Why didn't we?

00:25:57.920 --> 00:26:00.180
So what if we joined?

00:26:00.980 --> 00:26:03.620
Isn't it all about participating?

00:26:03.920 --> 00:26:06.900
There will be important moments in life.

00:26:07.780 --> 00:26:09.440
But this is not the moment.

00:26:15.480 --> 00:26:17.260
Everyone worked hard today.

00:26:17.800 --> 00:26:22.140
First, we need to thank St. Gloriana and Pravda...

00:26:22.500 --> 00:26:25.380
...along with Chihatan for agreeing to participate.

00:26:24.050 --> 00:26:26.720
<b>SAUNA ROOM</b>

00:26:25.600 --> 00:26:27.200
Thank you all

00:26:27.840 --> 00:26:31.840
Along with the judges and Japan's Senshado Federation

00:26:31.960 --> 00:26:34.120
North Kanto branch, Ibaraki 2nd District!

00:26:34.320 --> 00:26:36.300
I also got my first kill...

00:26:36.300 --> 00:26:37.960
Kawashima, too long!

00:26:38.740 --> 00:26:41.220
That's all! Everyone, please rest!

00:26:41.520 --> 00:26:42.680
Yes!

00:26:43.880 --> 00:26:47.840
Even though it's a friendly, victory still tastes good.

00:26:48.400 --> 00:26:50.640
Victories depend on luck.

00:26:52.280 --> 00:26:53.300
I'm leaving!

00:26:53.340 --> 00:26:56.500
If you don't take a long bath, you won't make a good commander.

00:26:56.900 --> 00:26:59.460
Get your shoulders underwater and count to one hundred.

00:26:59.830 --> 00:27:03.920
Раз, два, три, четыре...
Raz, dva, tri, chetyre...

00:27:02.320 --> 00:27:03.920
Count in Japanese!

00:27:04.040 --> 00:27:06.480
Commander Nishizumi, I'm so sorry!

00:27:07.040 --> 00:27:09.420
If it weren't for our reckless charges...

00:27:09.640 --> 00:27:13.060
It's nothing, it's an honor to fight alongside you.

00:27:13.440 --> 00:27:15.000
I learned a lot!

00:27:15.140 --> 00:27:17.020
What did you learn?

00:27:17.180 --> 00:27:19.480
Um... your spirit?

00:27:19.560 --> 00:27:20.340
I see!

00:27:21.320 --> 00:27:23.940
We begin our new semester next week!

00:27:24.820 --> 00:27:27.300
My homework isn't done yet!

00:27:28.300 --> 00:27:30.760
I have to get up early everyday again...

00:27:31.280 --> 00:27:33.740
It'd be great if school just disappeared!

00:27:34.360 --> 00:27:36.820
Didn't we fight to prevent our school from closing down?

00:27:37.120 --> 00:27:41.220
Oarai Girls High School Student Council President, Kadotani Anzu-sama...

00:27:41.620 --> 00:27:43.760
Please return to the school immediately.

00:27:44.080 --> 00:27:49.020
I repeat, Kadotani Anzu-sama, please return to the school immediately.

00:27:50.280 --> 00:27:51.700
What's going on? This is sudden.

00:27:51.880 --> 00:27:53.500
Anyway, I'll go on ahead.

00:28:03.400 --> 00:28:06.200
Why is everyone packing up?

00:28:06.740 --> 00:28:08.940
Is it a recycling thing?

00:28:09.280 --> 00:28:10.120
I don't know...

00:28:12.200 --> 00:28:14.760
Who did this!?

00:28:15.000 --> 00:28:17.520
No way... It's just vandalism, right?

00:28:18.220 --> 00:28:20.900
What does "KEEP OUT" mean?

00:28:21.020 --> 00:28:22.520
It means "KEEP fit...

00:28:22.520 --> 00:28:24.300
...if you didn't, you're OUT!"

00:28:24.340 --> 00:28:25.540
You're mean!

00:28:26.020 --> 00:28:28.540
This is not the time for jokes!

00:28:28.640 --> 00:28:30.920
Girls, stepping inside by yourselves would be troublesome.

00:28:33.920 --> 00:28:37.000
But... We're students here!

00:28:37.080 --> 00:28:39.080
Not anymore.

00:28:39.220 --> 00:28:40.460
What's the meaning of this?

00:28:40.980 --> 00:28:42.920
Why don't you tell them?

00:28:45.180 --> 00:28:45.940
Prez?

00:28:46.780 --> 00:28:48.540
What is this, Prez?

00:28:48.640 --> 00:28:49.320
Prez...!

00:28:49.840 --> 00:28:51.380
Oarai Girls High School...

00:28:52.260 --> 00:28:55.560
...will close on 31st August.

00:28:56.620 --> 00:28:59.300
As the school closes, the School Carrier will be scrapped.

00:28:59.540 --> 00:29:03.440
Wasn't it that if we won the tournament, the school wouldn't close down...?

00:29:03.900 --> 00:29:06.760
It appears that wasn't a definite promise.

00:29:06.900 --> 00:29:07.560
What?!

00:29:07.800 --> 00:29:10.160
It just opened up reconsideration.

00:29:10.380 --> 00:29:12.660
Nothing official, apparently.

00:29:13.020 --> 00:29:14.060
How...

00:29:14.320 --> 00:29:15.980
Isn't that too sudden?!

00:29:15.980 --> 00:29:20.060
Yeah, I thought even if it closed down, it would be in March!

00:29:20.120 --> 00:29:24.200
After discussions, they felt that March would be too late.

00:29:24.320 --> 00:29:26.760
Why make it even earlier?!

00:29:27.000 --> 00:29:30.040
Then what did we fight for?

00:29:30.320 --> 00:29:32.560
We fought to keep our school...

00:29:35.520 --> 00:29:38.460
Unacceptable! We must fight back!

00:29:38.460 --> 00:29:39.340
What are you planning to do?

00:29:39.340 --> 00:29:43.080
- We have to stay in the Carrier!
- Mutiny on the Bounty!

00:29:43.080 --> 00:29:45.290
- Potemkin! Potemkin!
- <i>Kanikousen</i>!

00:29:45.290 --> 00:29:47.290
- <i>The Caine Mutiny</i>!
- Aren't they fictional?

00:29:47.460 --> 00:29:49.480
It's unfortunate, but the school is really closing down!

00:29:53.360 --> 00:29:54.880
If we fight back,

00:29:55.240 --> 00:29:58.560
we'll screw it up for everyone living aboard the Carrier.

00:29:58.920 --> 00:30:00.740
He said he will fire everyone.

00:30:01.740 --> 00:30:02.920
This is too much!

00:30:03.040 --> 00:30:04.240
Ah, Momo-chan...!

00:30:04.420 --> 00:30:05.420
What does that mean?

00:30:05.480 --> 00:30:09.320
Are you saying that we're no longer the Morals Committee?

00:30:09.250 --> 00:30:09.960
That's what you care about?

00:30:09.960 --> 00:30:11.260
That is important!

00:30:11.320 --> 00:30:13.040
Then clubs will be gone too...

00:30:13.160 --> 00:30:15.640
The Volleyball Club will never be resurrected!

00:30:15.760 --> 00:30:17.580
The Automobile Club is gone too...

00:30:17.640 --> 00:30:19.580
Our dream of the School Carrier GP...

00:30:17.640 --> 00:30:19.580
<b>GP : GRAND PRIX</b>

00:30:19.580 --> 00:30:21.780
Does that mean we're no longer first-years?

00:30:21.980 --> 00:30:24.340
What will happen if we're no first-years?

00:30:24.400 --> 00:30:25.860
Real NEET...

00:30:25.920 --> 00:30:27.180
A penniless ronin...

00:30:27.300 --> 00:30:29.360
While the han is still here, we should just dappan!

00:30:29.380 --> 00:30:30.560
Didn't we already dappan...

00:30:30.620 --> 00:30:31.660
Everyone quiet down!

00:30:32.400 --> 00:30:34.600
Now, just calm down and follow instructions.

00:30:35.180 --> 00:30:37.460
Prez, is this really okay?

00:30:42.800 --> 00:30:45.060
I'm sure everyone's heard it.

00:30:45.440 --> 00:30:48.440
I'm sorry, but those who live in the dorms, please return to your rooms.

00:30:48.840 --> 00:30:52.740
Those who live with your families, be ready to move.

00:30:53.680 --> 00:30:54.280
Excuse me...

00:30:54.880 --> 00:30:56.640
What will happen to the tanks?

00:30:57.150 --> 00:30:59.820
<b>MEXT: JAPANESE MINISTRY OF EDUCATION, CULTURE, SPORTS, SCIENCE, AND TECHNOLOGY</b>

00:30:57.160 --> 00:30:59.370
They will be under the care of the MEXT.

00:30:59.800 --> 00:31:02.400
Even our tanks will be taken away?

00:31:02.400 --> 00:31:03.120
How could this be?

00:31:04.960 --> 00:31:05.660
I'm sorry.

00:31:18.040 --> 00:31:23.020
I didn't expect that we'd say goodbye to the school this way.

00:31:24.380 --> 00:31:29.150
We won't be needing these proposals and invoices anymore, right?

00:31:29.620 --> 00:31:31.220
Bring everything you can!

00:31:31.320 --> 00:31:34.220
This is our... history!

00:31:35.220 --> 00:31:37.200
I'm taking this chair, too!

00:31:37.700 --> 00:31:38.980
Here, come here!

00:31:39.820 --> 00:31:42.600
But I'm not the one in charge of the animals...

00:31:42.880 --> 00:31:44.450
I'm not particularly good with them.

00:31:44.540 --> 00:31:45.420
You'll get used to it.

00:31:45.500 --> 00:31:48.180
We just can't leave these kids behind, can't we?

00:31:48.960 --> 00:31:52.080
The Volleyball Club will never be resurrected, huh?

00:31:52.560 --> 00:31:55.420
Yeah... Since the school is going away...

00:31:56.840 --> 00:31:58.660
Let's have one final match!

00:31:58.800 --> 00:31:59.480
Yes!

00:32:01.820 --> 00:32:06.220
Every morning, we check for latecomers at the front gate...

00:32:06.460 --> 00:32:10.400
What will we live for after this?

00:32:10.560 --> 00:32:12.280
Should we take the gate, too?

00:32:13.140 --> 00:32:14.640
Good idea!

00:32:14.940 --> 00:32:16.180
I was joking.

00:32:19.380 --> 00:32:20.900
What are you doing?

00:32:20.900 --> 00:32:22.700
Oh, sorry.

00:32:30.780 --> 00:32:32.900
It's our last time driving here...

00:32:33.000 --> 00:32:34.880
Don't be sad, I'm speeding up!

00:32:34.980 --> 00:32:36.300
A final acceleration...

00:32:36.480 --> 00:32:39.060
Let's drift to our hearts' content!

00:32:39.320 --> 00:32:40.980
Do it!

00:32:43.160 --> 00:32:45.180
Everyone is leaving the ship...

00:32:45.300 --> 00:32:47.320
Just like the Kudoyama Chikkyo...

00:32:49.770 --> 00:32:55.190
<b>[Nekonya] We can meet here anytime,
even when we're parted</b>

00:32:50.730 --> 00:32:55.190
<b>[Piyotan] Even at midnight</b>

00:32:51.890 --> 00:32:55.190
<b>[Momoga] So we're not lonely at all!</b>

00:32:53.020 --> 00:32:55.190
<b>Momoga declared war on you!</b>

00:32:53.560 --> 00:32:55.190
<b>Piyotan declared war on you!</b>

00:32:56.480 --> 00:32:57.940
We can't make it!

00:32:57.940 --> 00:33:01.030
- Once we're on land, this shop won't make it!
- It's gonna be all right!

00:33:02.860 --> 00:33:03.780
Yukari, don't worry!

00:33:04.820 --> 00:33:05.390
Yeah...

00:33:07.080 --> 00:33:09.340
What? Ojou's school!?

00:33:09.840 --> 00:33:14.200
Seems we have to wait around a bit before the transfer.

00:33:14.200 --> 00:33:16.940
If that's the case, please come back...

00:33:17.020 --> 00:33:19.240
I can't come back bringing only myself...

00:33:19.640 --> 00:33:24.100
Plus, as long as the heart is alive, flowers can bloom anywhere.

00:33:24.500 --> 00:33:27.320
Got it? All our bedding is here.

00:33:29.120 --> 00:33:31.180
I went through a lot packing that!

00:33:31.420 --> 00:33:33.460
I can't sleep with another pillow

00:33:34.060 --> 00:33:35.760
Can't you sleep anywhere?

00:33:35.760 --> 00:33:37.500
It's not the same...

00:33:41.240 --> 00:33:42.320
This is everything.

00:33:46.260 --> 00:33:49.340
Tomorrow, we will leave our stuff here and disembark from the Carrier.

00:34:06.200 --> 00:34:07.580
I knew the Commander would be coming!

00:34:08.040 --> 00:34:09.320
Everyone is here!

00:34:17.100 --> 00:34:19.180
Even though you're small, you fought well...

00:34:20.020 --> 00:34:23.100
It wasn't a long time, but thank you for everything.

00:34:23.600 --> 00:34:26.260
You had a nice shot against Saunders.

00:34:26.780 --> 00:34:28.400
You did pretty well against Pravda, too!

00:34:28.700 --> 00:34:30.100
Found Miporin!

00:34:30.860 --> 00:34:32.600
We went to your room,

00:34:32.660 --> 00:34:34.880
but you were already on the way here, weren't you?

00:34:35.060 --> 00:34:36.880
Everyone seems to be here.

00:34:37.860 --> 00:34:40.480
Does Mako-san plan to sleep here?

00:34:40.820 --> 00:34:46.460
Yeah, because... this might be goodbye.

00:35:16.620 --> 00:35:18.480
That's Saunders University High School's...

00:35:19.240 --> 00:35:22.360
...C-5M Super Galaxy airlifter!

00:35:23.540 --> 00:35:26.520
Saunders will keeping our tanks.

00:35:27.400 --> 00:35:28.760
Is this all right?

00:35:29.160 --> 00:35:31.560
I filed a document saying that we lost them.

00:35:31.760 --> 00:35:34.100
This way we can keep them safe!

00:35:35.760 --> 00:35:36.900
Kept you waiting!

00:35:36.900 --> 00:35:39.000
You guys are giving us a hassle.

00:35:40.760 --> 00:35:43.940
- Thank you! Thank you!
- It's nothing!

00:35:44.220 --> 00:35:46.120
Okay, everyone, hurry up!

00:35:46.340 --> 00:35:47.120
Yes!

00:35:58.500 --> 00:35:59.860
They're all here.

00:36:01.600 --> 00:36:03.680
When you're sure of your destination, contact us.

00:36:04.200 --> 00:36:06.440
Okay, thanks!

00:36:06.660 --> 00:36:08.000
We'll deliver them for you!

00:36:12.300 --> 00:36:13.780
Is this okay?

00:36:13.780 --> 00:36:15.800
Seems heavy, can it take off?

00:36:15.800 --> 00:36:17.220
Do your best!

00:36:29.300 --> 00:36:32.820
I'm glad... Even if we couldn't protect our school...

00:36:32.820 --> 00:36:34.900
At least we were able to protect our tanks.

00:36:38.910 --> 00:36:40.910
Yeah.

00:36:46.630 --> 00:36:49.550
Thank you!
Oarai Girls High School
by Senshado Team

00:36:58.020 --> 00:36:59.400
Is everyone here?

00:36:59.820 --> 00:37:00.890
Yes.

00:37:02.500 --> 00:37:04.320
The ship is departing.

00:37:04.680 --> 00:37:06.460
Is this goodbye?

00:37:06.460 --> 00:37:07.120
See you.

00:37:07.400 --> 00:37:10.060
This is sadder than breaking up with my boyfriend.

00:37:10.060 --> 00:37:11.680
Even though you never had one?

00:37:15.860 --> 00:37:18.990
- Don't go!
- Say goodbye with a smile!

00:37:19.000 --> 00:37:22.830
- Thank you!
- Be healthy!

00:37:23.540 --> 00:37:27.120
Goodbye!

00:37:27.560 --> 00:37:31.700
Goodbye!

00:38:09.340 --> 00:38:11.340
More buses are separating, huh...

00:38:11.680 --> 00:38:13.400
Because there were too many students...

00:38:13.400 --> 00:38:16.220
...everyone was sorted based on their clubs.

00:38:14.380 --> 00:38:19.390
<b>RESERVED</b>

00:38:16.540 --> 00:38:19.700
So it seems the Senshado team is grouped together...

00:38:20.460 --> 00:38:22.120
Let's have some snacks first!

00:38:22.440 --> 00:38:24.000
Let's eat together!

00:38:27.040 --> 00:38:31.480
Before the transfer is completed, everyone will be staying here!

00:38:31.880 --> 00:38:34.180
The classrooms are already arranged by student years.

00:38:34.560 --> 00:38:36.140
So please return to your respective rooms!

00:38:36.240 --> 00:38:38.000
Yeah...

00:38:38.380 --> 00:38:39.960
Momo-chan, are you all right?

00:38:41.500 --> 00:38:44.580
It's times like this when we have to be strong.

00:38:45.800 --> 00:38:50.460
Also, I'm sure the Prez will think of something... I hope.

00:38:54.940 --> 00:38:56.550
We're in the same room!

00:38:57.160 --> 00:38:59.020
Leave this to me!

00:38:59.820 --> 00:39:01.880
I also have all sorts of rations!

00:39:02.200 --> 00:39:03.980
Please wait a bit!

00:39:06.520 --> 00:39:08.640
She's so energetic.

00:39:08.720 --> 00:39:09.720
So strong.

00:39:09.860 --> 00:39:11.120
I want to learn from her.

00:39:16.600 --> 00:39:19.000
We're no longer on the sea...

00:39:20.360 --> 00:39:22.460
We can't hear the sound of the waves.

00:39:22.840 --> 00:39:25.100
Or smell the saltiness of the sea.

00:39:26.220 --> 00:39:29.140
Hills are all right, they're full of greenery.

00:39:29.140 --> 00:39:30.700
That's true, but...

00:40:18.320 --> 00:40:20.700
They're delivering them just like they promised!

00:40:20.920 --> 00:40:21.750
Great!

00:40:21.840 --> 00:40:23.720
I feel better knowing that our tanks are safe!

00:40:23.940 --> 00:40:25.310
Delivery complete!

00:40:25.310 --> 00:40:26.660
Thanks a lot!

00:40:26.660 --> 00:40:28.370
This favor won't come cheap!

00:40:28.370 --> 00:40:28.810
Eh?

00:40:29.440 --> 00:40:32.220
To repay the favor, you have to keep practicing Senshado!

00:40:32.790 --> 00:40:35.150
Because we'll beat you the next time we meet!

00:40:35.600 --> 00:40:36.360
Yes!

00:40:39.580 --> 00:40:42.800
Looks like we're gonna live here for the time being.

00:40:43.770 --> 00:40:46.180
Is this okay? Staying here like this?

00:40:48.060 --> 00:40:51.290
Even here, you have to do it the same way as if we were on the Carrier.

00:40:51.340 --> 00:40:55.190
Take a roll call every morning to make sure everyone is safe.

00:40:55.590 --> 00:40:56.290
Understood!

00:40:57.960 --> 00:40:59.750
By the way, how is the Morals Committee?

00:41:05.170 --> 00:41:07.680
Hey! As the Morals Committee, this is shameful!

00:41:07.820 --> 00:41:08.610
Fix yourselves up!

00:41:09.550 --> 00:41:14.510
The school is gone, why should we fix ourselves up?

00:41:15.510 --> 00:41:17.300
This is meaningless!

00:41:17.590 --> 00:41:22.490
- Even our reason to exist is gone...
- Cut it out! Before the transfer is complete, you have to do your job!

00:41:24.000 --> 00:41:25.840
Everyone, gather up!

00:41:25.970 --> 00:41:29.680
The school is gone, shouldn't it be okay to not wake up early?

00:41:30.290 --> 00:41:32.420
I hear they'll be doing a roll call every day.

00:41:32.810 --> 00:41:35.060
At least wash your face, Sodoko!

00:41:35.200 --> 00:41:38.520
Sure, sure, I'm just Sodoko anyway.

00:41:39.030 --> 00:41:40.800
Roll call time!

00:41:41.100 --> 00:41:42.220
Everyone's here, right?

00:41:43.090 --> 00:41:44.340
All right, done!

00:41:44.610 --> 00:41:47.430
For a roll call, that was pretty lazy...

00:41:47.810 --> 00:41:49.410
Work hard even though it's a hot summer day!

00:41:49.620 --> 00:41:50.960
Shout loudly!

00:41:51.120 --> 00:41:51.680
Yes!

00:41:51.830 --> 00:41:52.990
Take this!

00:41:55.760 --> 00:41:59.270
- Use this chance to train!
- That's right!

00:42:00.930 --> 00:42:02.140
We must work harder...

00:42:07.220 --> 00:42:08.210
I have lost!

00:42:08.550 --> 00:42:09.620
I think so too.

00:42:15.490 --> 00:42:16.870
What are you fishing?

00:42:17.200 --> 00:42:18.230
Anglerfish...

00:42:19.000 --> 00:42:20.500
I think that's impossible...

00:42:21.030 --> 00:42:22.850
Then, oysters...

00:42:23.260 --> 00:42:25.330
That's even more impossible...

00:42:25.730 --> 00:42:26.920
A goby then.

00:42:31.040 --> 00:42:32.830
This is good training!

00:42:33.160 --> 00:42:34.220
Don't push it too hard.

00:42:58.920 --> 00:43:02.310
I never thought we'd drive to a convenience store in a tank.

00:43:02.640 --> 00:43:04.870
At least there's some use for my tank driving license.

00:43:05.330 --> 00:43:08.180
At least try and stay awake for your license photo!

00:43:08.370 --> 00:43:10.720
My photo is good enough for an arranged date!

00:43:11.280 --> 00:43:13.160
You work hard for some pointless stuff.

00:43:13.610 --> 00:43:17.960
Right, I think there are buses to Ibaraki in front of the store.

00:43:18.350 --> 00:43:19.970
I have to check the timetable.

00:43:20.150 --> 00:43:20.870
Why?

00:43:21.270 --> 00:43:23.450
I have to go back to my parents.

00:43:23.970 --> 00:43:27.150
You need your guardian's signature on your transfer document.

00:43:27.540 --> 00:43:28.280
Guardian...

00:43:29.970 --> 00:43:31.970
Gotta go back to your grandma...

00:43:32.180 --> 00:43:33.480
What a hassle.

00:43:34.200 --> 00:43:36.240
She'll just lecture me again.

00:43:36.540 --> 00:43:38.290
I have to go back too.

00:43:39.480 --> 00:43:40.360
What about Miho-san?

00:43:41.240 --> 00:43:42.160
Want us to go with you?

00:43:42.570 --> 00:43:45.140
I want to see the home of the Nishizumi style!

00:43:45.490 --> 00:43:48.310
It's okay, I can go alone.

00:43:48.600 --> 00:43:49.700
Oh...

00:43:50.130 --> 00:43:51.710
We'll go together next time!

00:43:52.390 --> 00:43:52.960
Yes!

00:43:53.160 --> 00:43:55.320
I'm going home tomorrow.

00:43:55.680 --> 00:43:57.350
Maybe I should do the same as well...

00:43:57.430 --> 00:43:58.690
Me too.

00:44:00.100 --> 00:44:00.920
Please stop!

00:44:02.160 --> 00:44:03.370
Reverse!

00:44:04.420 --> 00:44:05.590
What's wrong?

00:44:09.360 --> 00:44:11.030
<b>Boko Museum</b>

00:44:09.360 --> 00:44:11.030
<b>Turn left in 500m</b>

00:44:11.030 --> 00:44:13.940
<b>Boko
Museum</b>

00:44:13.120 --> 00:44:16.000
I didn't know this had such a place!

00:44:16.200 --> 00:44:18.530
I've never seen you this excited!

00:44:19.420 --> 00:44:21.210
What a coincidence that you're here!

00:44:21.430 --> 00:44:23.040
I'll take on you guys!

00:44:23.260 --> 00:44:24.840
I'll beat you up real good!

00:44:24.890 --> 00:44:27.030
It's the real Boko! So cute!

00:44:27.230 --> 00:44:30.300
- What are you doing? Stop it!
- I didn't do anything...

00:44:30.800 --> 00:44:32.090
I'm defeated!

00:44:32.560 --> 00:44:33.950
Remember this!

00:44:33.990 --> 00:44:35.370
But we didn't do anything...

00:44:35.370 --> 00:44:36.910
This guy is unexpectedly weak...

00:44:36.950 --> 00:44:38.230
That's why it's Boko!

00:44:38.240 --> 00:44:40.480
Like Italy's 10th Army!

00:44:40.790 --> 00:44:44.650
Looks like there are no visitors apart from us...

00:44:45.330 --> 00:44:47.510
What a coincidence that you're here!

00:44:48.070 --> 00:44:49.700
This is "It's a 'Beat-up' World".

00:44:51.490 --> 00:44:52.870
"'Beated-up' Mansion"

00:44:54.580 --> 00:44:56.180
"Space Beat-up-ssey"

00:44:57.350 --> 00:44:59.080
You ran into me! Watch where you go!

00:45:00.260 --> 00:45:01.770
How arrogant! Get him!

00:45:02.390 --> 00:45:04.790
Interesting, let me counter-attack!

00:45:05.540 --> 00:45:07.130
You're not as strong as you say!

00:45:08.500 --> 00:45:11.140
Everyone, give me strength...!

00:45:11.170 --> 00:45:12.480
Boko, try your best!

00:45:12.510 --> 00:45:14.340
- More strength!
- Try your best!

00:45:14.340 --> 00:45:15.260
- More!

00:45:16.200 --> 00:45:17.260
- Try...
- Try your best, Boko!

00:45:17.610 --> 00:45:19.090
Try your best, Boko!

00:45:19.170 --> 00:45:22.060
- Boko, try your best!
- Mr. Boko, please try your best!

00:45:22.130 --> 00:45:23.060
Fight!

00:45:23.060 --> 00:45:24.530
Here it comes!

00:45:24.770 --> 00:45:27.400
I am stronger because of your help!

00:45:27.560 --> 00:45:28.770
Thank you!

00:45:28.800 --> 00:45:30.770
I'll destroy you now!

00:45:31.700 --> 00:45:33.200
"Stronger" huh? This all you got?

00:45:33.100 --> 00:45:33.840
The heck is this?

00:45:33.870 --> 00:45:36.160
In the end he got beat up anyway...

00:45:36.390 --> 00:45:37.600
Because that's what Boko is all about!

00:45:37.880 --> 00:45:39.760
I lost again...

00:45:40.510 --> 00:45:42.100
I'll try harder next time!

00:45:42.960 --> 00:45:45.030
Boko fought really hard!

00:45:45.290 --> 00:45:46.240
Yeah...?

00:45:45.830 --> 00:45:48.880
Last one! Super-rare Boko

00:45:46.630 --> 00:45:47.760
This is the last one left...

00:45:47.820 --> 00:45:49.020
It's just a selling strategy...

00:45:49.020 --> 00:45:50.240
But it's cute!

00:45:52.980 --> 00:45:53.830
It's all right!

00:45:56.470 --> 00:45:57.800
I'll come again another time!

00:46:04.030 --> 00:46:06.310
Miporin went out of her way to give her the toy

00:46:06.310 --> 00:46:07.860
but she didn't even say thanks...

00:46:08.200 --> 00:46:09.840
I bet she's just too shy...

00:46:12.780 --> 00:46:15.010
About the school closing down, it's already decided.

00:46:15.400 --> 00:46:19.670
But you told me that as long as we won the Tournament, the school would continue to operate.

00:46:19.960 --> 00:46:22.360
A verbal promise isn't really an agreement.

00:46:22.710 --> 00:46:25.600
There are cases where verbal agreements can be legally binding.

00:46:26.120 --> 00:46:29.690
It's written in Articles 91 and 97 of the Civil Code of Japan.

00:46:30.660 --> 00:46:34.500
I already did all I could. Please understand.

00:46:36.150 --> 00:46:37.000
I understand.

00:46:37.510 --> 00:46:38.720
<b>STAFF ROOM
(Temporary
Student Council Room)</b>

00:46:37.920 --> 00:46:40.060
We've used up all our insect repellent!

00:46:40.160 --> 00:46:41.650
Understood, I'll see to it immediately.

00:46:41.800 --> 00:46:43.650
We don't have enough rice for the meals.

00:46:43.700 --> 00:46:45.810
Understood, I'll arrange it with the local farmers.

00:46:45.810 --> 00:46:47.440
The light bulb in the corridor is broken!

00:46:47.300 --> 00:46:48.650
I'll get a replacement from an electric shop.

00:46:48.500 --> 00:46:49.270
This is bad!

00:46:49.590 --> 00:46:52.080
The three moral committee members are in a row with local students here!

00:46:52.080 --> 00:46:53.920
Go deal with those three girls!

00:46:54.880 --> 00:46:55.620
Understood

00:46:55.920 --> 00:46:56.440
What?

00:46:56.650 --> 00:46:58.890
I was just thinking that Momo-chan's doing her job pretty well.

00:46:59.680 --> 00:47:01.700
I thought you'd be crying and stuff.

00:47:02.100 --> 00:47:05.440
"Oh no! It's closing down! It's over, Yuzu-chan!"

00:47:05.680 --> 00:47:06.940
I don't have time for that!

00:47:07.250 --> 00:47:09.430
If I don't work hard now, then when will I?

00:47:09.960 --> 00:47:10.920
You're right.

00:47:13.090 --> 00:47:15.170
I wonder where the prez is...

00:47:15.840 --> 00:47:18.640
I'm sure the prez is doing stuff only the she can do...

00:47:19.700 --> 00:47:22.420
Once MEXT makes a decision,

00:47:22.520 --> 00:47:25.790
we just can't change it easily.

00:47:26.160 --> 00:47:28.640
You'll lose face, is that what you mean?

00:47:28.900 --> 00:47:30.930
Something like that.

00:47:31.010 --> 00:47:32.380
Speaking of "losing face"...

00:47:32.630 --> 00:47:35.910
Allowing the school of the tournament winners to close down...

00:47:36.060 --> 00:47:38.590
That is what will make the Federation lose face!

00:47:39.540 --> 00:47:42.690
Chouno, you're one of the members of the Strengthening Committee, right?

00:47:42.790 --> 00:47:43.620
But Director!

00:47:44.000 --> 00:47:47.560
This act is against the nation's policy of encouraging Senshado

00:47:47.760 --> 00:47:49.360
furthermore, it'll damage our image.

00:47:51.150 --> 00:47:55.630
We fought believing that if we won the tournament, we'd save our school.

00:47:56.010 --> 00:47:58.850
And to learn that promise wasn't true from the start...

00:47:59.030 --> 00:48:00.390
We cannot accept it.

00:48:00.600 --> 00:48:07.470
But the MEXT is already occupied with the World Tournament coming up in two years.

00:48:07.770 --> 00:48:11.990
They're starting pro leagues to scout for contestants.

00:48:12.090 --> 00:48:13.920
They don't have time to deal with this.

00:48:14.360 --> 00:48:16.300
"Pro league", that's it...

00:48:17.300 --> 00:48:19.550
It's time for a pivot turn...

00:48:21.050 --> 00:48:21.620
Eh?

00:48:24.700 --> 00:48:26.750
Red Potato

00:48:34.300 --> 00:48:35.250
Miho!

00:48:39.010 --> 00:48:39.880
Onee-chan...

00:48:41.460 --> 00:48:42.760
Welcome home.

00:48:45.110 --> 00:48:46.100
Is this okay?

00:48:45.800 --> 00:48:49.850
This is your home, you can always come back without worries.

00:48:51.940 --> 00:48:52.690
Maho?

00:48:53.750 --> 00:48:54.280
Yes.

00:48:54.370 --> 00:48:55.370
Do we have guests?

00:48:56.020 --> 00:48:57.400
Just a friend from school.

00:48:58.810 --> 00:48:59.430
Oh?

00:49:06.310 --> 00:49:06.960
What's the matter?

00:49:07.940 --> 00:49:08.810
Nothing has changed...

00:49:09.710 --> 00:49:10.330
Where's the document?

00:49:13.670 --> 00:49:14.160
Here.

00:49:18.820 --> 00:49:19.760
Give me a moment...

00:49:21.240 --> 00:49:21.780
Sure...

00:49:43.970 --> 00:49:44.530
Miho.

00:49:45.120 --> 00:49:47.030
Nishizumi Shiho

00:49:45.610 --> 00:49:48.530
Onee-chan, this signature and stamp...

00:49:48.700 --> 00:49:49.420
Shh!

00:49:53.720 --> 00:49:55.690
Are you sure I should just drop you off at the station?

00:49:56.030 --> 00:49:57.600
Yeah, thanks.

00:50:01.200 --> 00:50:02.910
This place hasn't changed, too...

00:51:16.540 --> 00:51:18.710
A souvenir from a friend
- Maho

00:51:19.670 --> 00:51:20.340
Master.

00:51:21.650 --> 00:51:22.920
Chouno-sama is here.

00:51:24.260 --> 00:51:25.180
Understood.

00:51:29.060 --> 00:51:32.590
If Oarai can't join the Tournament next year...

00:51:33.100 --> 00:51:36.180
...then Kuromorimine can't defeat them.

00:51:37.260 --> 00:51:40.610
We can't have pro league crewmembers without training novices.

00:51:41.140 --> 00:51:42.960
If we have such a huge different in ideologies,

00:51:43.170 --> 00:51:47.270
then I cannot be the Chairperson of the Pro League Committee.

00:51:47.530 --> 00:51:48.520
But, then...

00:51:49.080 --> 00:51:51.460
If we don't start doing pro league matches this year,

00:51:51.820 --> 00:51:54.340
we'll have trouble recruiting people for the World Tournament.

00:51:54.340 --> 00:51:55.940
You are aware of this, right?

00:51:56.270 --> 00:51:58.430
Shutting down the school that won...

00:51:58.690 --> 00:52:01.940
Isn't that counter to MEXT's goal of strengthening Senshado?

00:52:02.120 --> 00:52:05.080
But this is a school that won through luck...

00:52:06.090 --> 00:52:07.640
There is no luck in Senshado!

00:52:08.180 --> 00:52:09.430
There is only skill.

00:52:10.360 --> 00:52:11.940
What should they do for you to accept them?

00:52:13.710 --> 00:52:17.190
Well, if Oarai could win against the University team...

00:52:17.230 --> 00:52:18.250
Understood!

00:52:18.520 --> 00:52:20.760
If we win, you'll take back your decision, right?

00:52:20.870 --> 00:52:21.140
Eh?

00:52:21.140 --> 00:52:23.730
Please sign here, right now!

00:52:24.460 --> 00:52:28.410
You said a verbal agreement doesn't count, right?

00:52:30.210 --> 00:52:33.060
Congratulations, fellow Master.

00:52:33.750 --> 00:52:34.880
Thank you very much.

00:52:35.490 --> 00:52:38.610
I thought it would be best to come here immediately

00:52:38.880 --> 00:52:41.990
to notify the Master of Shimada style and the head of the University team.

00:52:42.360 --> 00:52:43.280
I see.

00:52:43.730 --> 00:52:46.140
Since we'll be participating, I won't be holding back.

00:52:51.710 --> 00:52:52.750
Match completed.

00:52:53.320 --> 00:52:55.600
The unpredictable tactics...

00:52:55.700 --> 00:52:57.860
They call them "Ninja Tactics"...

00:52:58.050 --> 00:53:00.530
The essence of Japanese Senshado...

00:53:00.840 --> 00:53:03.020
Only the successor to Shimada style can pull them off!

00:53:06.150 --> 00:53:07.280
It's started...

00:53:08.640 --> 00:53:10.800
Good thing I have it recording...

00:53:10.870 --> 00:53:13.020
Commander, do you have something to do?

00:53:13.890 --> 00:53:15.290
Nothing to worry about.

00:53:15.680 --> 00:53:18.310
The Master called just now.

00:53:18.570 --> 00:53:19.490
From mother?

00:53:21.000 --> 00:53:23.080
Please destroy them.

00:53:23.410 --> 00:53:25.590
Destroy the name of Nishizumi style

00:53:26.290 --> 00:53:28.050
I understand the matter of the match.

00:53:28.660 --> 00:53:30.220
I have a favor to ask of you, too.

00:53:31.050 --> 00:53:31.630
What is it?

00:53:32.040 --> 00:53:35.830
If I won, please become the sponsor of the Boko Musuem.

00:53:36.240 --> 00:53:38.360
At its current state, the museum will close down.

00:53:39.610 --> 00:53:40.550
Fine, I suppose.

00:53:41.300 --> 00:53:42.630
Thank you, Mother.

00:53:46.880 --> 00:53:50.070
Don't worry, I'll save you.

00:54:17.200 --> 00:54:18.020
I'm back!

00:54:22.320 --> 00:54:24.460
Prez!

00:54:32.160 --> 00:54:33.310
Special announcement! Special announcement!

00:54:33.830 --> 00:54:38.620
The president is back! All Senshado members, please meet in the hall!

00:54:38.620 --> 00:54:42.290
I repeat: Special announcement! Special announcement!

00:54:38.620 --> 00:54:42.290
For now, let's go!

00:54:42.490 --> 00:54:48.250
The president is back! All Senshado members, please meet in the hall!

00:54:42.490 --> 00:54:48.250
- Do you hear something weird in the background?
- Sounds scary!

00:54:48.450 --> 00:54:51.200
I repeat: Special announcement! Special announcement!

00:54:51.790 --> 00:54:53.250
Momo-chan, be quiet for a bit.

00:54:55.540 --> 00:54:57.200
Is everyone here?

00:54:57.440 --> 00:54:59.220
Mallard team isn't here!

00:54:59.270 --> 00:55:00.600
What?

00:55:01.490 --> 00:55:02.360
Where are you going?

00:55:02.630 --> 00:55:04.360
To catch the latecomers.

00:55:05.310 --> 00:55:06.250
What are you doing?

00:55:08.840 --> 00:55:09.800
None of your business.

00:55:10.850 --> 00:55:11.720
We're assembling.

00:55:11.990 --> 00:55:12.600
Don't wanna.

00:55:14.320 --> 00:55:16.990
- Just come with me!
- What are you doing? Let go!

00:55:17.140 --> 00:55:19.360
Forget about us!

00:55:19.360 --> 00:55:21.750
Without Sodoko, the morals of the school will be gone!

00:55:23.700 --> 00:55:25.080
Also, I'm a bit lonely...

00:55:28.420 --> 00:55:31.770
We're not lonely!

00:55:38.970 --> 00:55:40.520
Please don't do that...

00:55:40.750 --> 00:55:43.060
Everyone, a match has been decided!

00:55:43.490 --> 00:55:44.160
A match?

00:55:44.750 --> 00:55:46.110
Against the University Strengthened Team.

00:55:47.330 --> 00:55:49.380
If we win against them,

00:55:49.730 --> 00:55:51.900
This time, for sure, they'll take back their decision to close down the school.

00:55:52.580 --> 00:55:54.740
I have documents signed by the Minister of MEXT...

00:55:55.450 --> 00:55:58.050
Along with approval from the Senshado Federation, University Senshado Federation...

00:55:58.340 --> 00:56:00.720
And High School Senshado Federation

00:56:00.800 --> 00:56:02.590
As expected from the Prez!

00:56:03.030 --> 00:56:05.230
You've been negotiating for us all this time!

00:56:05.300 --> 00:56:08.450
Prez, you're not hiding anything this time, are you?

00:56:08.660 --> 00:56:09.220
Nope!

00:56:09.590 --> 00:56:12.360
If we win, the school really won't close down?

00:56:12.530 --> 00:56:13.190
Yup!

00:56:15.180 --> 00:56:17.220
I know it's going to be a tough battle.

00:56:18.850 --> 00:56:20.690
But we must win.

00:56:21.890 --> 00:56:23.340
That way, everyone can return to Ooarai...

00:56:23.960 --> 00:56:26.060
And return to our School Carrier!

00:56:29.390 --> 00:56:30.520
Yeah!

00:56:32.620 --> 00:56:33.510
Let's do our best!

00:56:34.520 --> 00:56:36.370
You should cheer as well!

00:56:36.550 --> 00:56:37.570
Yeah, yeah.

00:56:38.320 --> 00:56:39.460
Nishizumi-dono...

00:56:44.660 --> 00:56:46.470
They won against the adult team!?!

00:56:46.470 --> 00:56:48.170
This is too tough for us!

00:56:48.170 --> 00:56:49.400
I told you it'd be tough.

00:56:49.400 --> 00:56:50.710
What do you think, Nishizumi?

00:56:50.820 --> 00:56:53.890
I feel like their commander looks familiar...

00:56:56.300 --> 00:56:59.420
I heard she's a young prodigy, who skipped grades to university.

00:56:59.540 --> 00:57:02.000
And the Shimada style Master's daughter.

00:57:02.430 --> 00:57:06.640
So this match is also the showdown between Nishizumi style and Shimada style...

00:57:07.000 --> 00:57:09.140
Then, how many tanks are they fielding?

00:57:09.580 --> 00:57:10.400
Thirty tanks.

00:57:10.550 --> 00:57:11.250
Eh?

00:57:11.300 --> 00:57:12.380
It's over!

00:57:12.600 --> 00:57:15.210
Nishizumi, tell her we can't win this!

00:57:15.450 --> 00:57:17.970
Considering our current situation, there's no way we'll win.

00:57:19.400 --> 00:57:23.060
But I think it's remarkable that this chance was given to us.

00:57:23.140 --> 00:57:23.630
Eh?

00:57:23.950 --> 00:57:25.060
Even if we can't win...

00:57:25.490 --> 00:57:27.370
There's no path a tank cannot traverse!

00:57:27.770 --> 00:57:30.200
Tanks move forward even under enemy fire...

00:57:30.560 --> 00:57:32.980
No matter how tough it is, we must think of a way to overcome!

00:57:33.120 --> 00:57:33.470
Yes!

00:57:33.820 --> 00:57:34.680
Understood!

00:57:43.840 --> 00:57:45.570
What's an annihilation match?

00:57:45.690 --> 00:57:48.400
You win by knocking out all the enemy tanks.

00:57:48.600 --> 00:57:49.600
I see...

00:57:49.600 --> 00:57:51.990
But, we're already at 30 to 8 tanks

00:57:52.210 --> 00:57:54.320
Now you're saying it's an annihilation match...

00:57:54.670 --> 00:57:56.030
In the upcoming pro league matches,

00:57:56.030 --> 00:57:58.230
annihilation matches will be the default,

00:57:58.350 --> 00:57:59.880
so we'd like you to adjust.

00:58:00.210 --> 00:58:03.670
They say that they're already setting up for an annihilation match.

00:58:04.050 --> 00:58:06.450
If you're withdrawing, please let us know immediately.

00:58:16.610 --> 00:58:17.710
I'm putting a lot of pressure on you.

00:58:18.600 --> 00:58:19.500
Don't worry about it.

00:58:19.990 --> 00:58:21.660
How prepared are we? For tomorrow's match?

00:58:21.940 --> 00:58:22.340
Eh?

00:58:23.620 --> 00:58:25.290
There's always the option to withdraw...

00:58:25.630 --> 00:58:26.680
That's not an option!

00:58:27.530 --> 00:58:29.810
If we withdraw, it's really over for us.

00:58:31.700 --> 00:58:32.150
Yeah!

00:58:34.300 --> 00:58:35.880
It'll be a cruel match, right?

00:58:36.360 --> 00:58:38.660
Our matches have always been like that.

00:58:40.180 --> 00:58:40.680
But...

00:58:41.510 --> 00:58:42.960
Miporin!

00:58:44.960 --> 00:58:46.050
We still have our comrades!

00:59:11.670 --> 00:59:15.390
Long sobs of autumn violins

00:59:16.190 --> 00:59:20.550
Wound my heart with a monotonous languor

00:59:21.740 --> 00:59:25.320
Only to drink this cup in the Northern Lands

00:59:26.600 --> 00:59:27.900
It's some boiling black tea.

00:59:30.740 --> 00:59:33.120
I've never tried black tea.

00:59:33.680 --> 00:59:35.540
The tea party sounds fun!

00:59:36.080 --> 00:59:38.340
Although I don't condone hedonism...

00:59:47.400 --> 00:59:49.940
Lure them to the hills, then split up their forces.

00:59:50.380 --> 00:59:52.820
If we can take them out one by one, victory should be in sight...

00:59:53.710 --> 00:59:56.390
But the enemy have much better experience and equipment...

00:59:56.800 --> 00:59:58.430
Maybe this time...

01:00:03.780 --> 01:00:08.470
Now, then: the Oarai Girls High School against University Team will now begin.

01:00:10.700 --> 01:00:11.400
Salute!

01:00:11.400 --> 01:00:12.190
Let's have—

01:00:12.190 --> 01:00:13.470
Hold it!

01:00:19.680 --> 01:00:21.680
Ah, Onee-chan?

01:00:26.690 --> 01:00:29.010
Oarai Girls High School, Nishizumi Maho.

01:00:29.010 --> 01:00:30.450
Ditto, Itsumi Erika.

01:00:30.670 --> 01:00:32.950
A total of 18 students, here to join the match.

01:00:33.530 --> 01:00:35.580
The short-term transfer documents were already dealt with...

01:00:36.260 --> 01:00:38.280
Along with the Federation's approval.

01:00:40.460 --> 01:00:43.340
Onee-chan... thanks!

01:00:44.980 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>Pz IV Ausf H</b>

01:00:44.980 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>Hetzer</b>

01:00:44.980 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>Type 89A</b>

01:00:44.980 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>StuG III Ausf. F</b>

01:00:44.980 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>M3 Lee</b>

01:00:44.980 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>Renault B1 bis</b>

01:00:44.980 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>Porsche Tiger</b>

01:00:44.980 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>Type 3 Chi-Nu</b>

01:00:45.940 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>Tiger 1</b>

01:00:45.940 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>Tiger II</b>

01:00:45.940 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>Panther G</b>

01:00:45.940 --> 01:00:47.400
<b>Panther G</b>

01:00:46.490 --> 01:00:48.600
Bringing the tanks along with them is against the rules!

01:00:48.730 --> 01:00:50.930
Those are private property.

01:00:50.970 --> 01:00:53.500
Are there rules against bringing along private property?

01:00:53.500 --> 01:00:54.380
That's underhanded!

01:00:58.450 --> 01:01:00.290
We also transferred!

01:01:00.290 --> 01:01:01.770
We're teammates now!

01:01:01.770 --> 01:01:02.680
Prepare yourself!

01:01:02.780 --> 01:01:04.200
Saunders is here!

01:01:04.320 --> 01:01:07.810
I didn't think we'd get Kuromorimine and Saunders' support...

01:01:07.810 --> 01:01:09.250
Like cherries on top!

01:01:09.250 --> 01:01:10.530
Like tigers with wings!

01:01:14.950 --> 01:01:17.230
Hey, someone got there before us!

01:01:17.460 --> 01:01:19.080
Who's been sleeping the whole time?

01:01:19.080 --> 01:01:21.860
It's not like I want to come or anything!

01:01:21.860 --> 01:01:24.960
Maybe you wanted to look cool by being the first to arrive.

01:01:24.960 --> 01:01:26.320
Shut it!

01:01:29.630 --> 01:01:33.390
We'll change into our usual tank clothes for the match, right?

01:01:33.810 --> 01:01:37.200
Then why are we all meeting up wearing the Ooarai uniform?

01:01:37.490 --> 01:01:39.290
Everyone told me that they wanted to try it out.

01:01:39.380 --> 01:01:41.660
St. Gloriana and Pravda as well...

01:01:44.550 --> 01:01:48.520
People of Oarai! The Duce from the nation of passion, style, and pasta is here!

01:01:48.680 --> 01:01:49.950
Surprised?

01:01:49.950 --> 01:01:51.940
It's good we made it...

01:01:51.940 --> 01:01:54.820
Hippo team's Taka-chan, we're here!

01:01:54.820 --> 01:01:55.490
Hina-chan!

01:01:55.840 --> 01:01:57.170
Uh, I'm Caesar!

01:01:58.520 --> 01:02:02.660
Hi everyone, we've transferred from Continuation High School!

01:02:03.300 --> 01:02:05.790
In the end, we've come to help!

01:02:06.410 --> 01:02:09.020
No, I was just blown here with the wind.

01:02:09.200 --> 01:02:12.600
Sorry for the wait! Yesterday's foes are today's friends!

01:02:12.600 --> 01:02:15.810
The twenty-two brave steel lions are here!

01:02:15.810 --> 01:02:18.970
We agreed that we'd bring twenty-two tanks in total, right?

01:02:19.160 --> 01:02:20.690
That means you bring six!

01:02:20.880 --> 01:02:23.370
Sorry, I made a mistake!

01:02:23.500 --> 01:02:24.690
The remaining sixteen tanks, await orders!

01:02:26.630 --> 01:02:27.890
Maybe we have a chance at winning!

01:02:27.970 --> 01:02:30.920
Isn't it against the rule to add participants at the beginning of a match?

01:02:31.160 --> 01:02:33.660
Only the opposing team can file an objection to it.

01:02:34.090 --> 01:02:36.820
We don't mind. We'll take them on.

01:02:37.480 --> 01:02:38.960
Please start the match.

01:02:43.560 --> 01:02:47.850
<b>Team Composition</b>

01:02:43.560 --> 01:02:47.850
<b>1. Pz IV, Churchill, Matilda, Crusader, BT41, CV33, B1 bis, Porsche Tiger, Type 3, Type 89</b>

01:02:43.560 --> 01:02:47.850
<b>2. Tiger, Tiger II, Panther x 2, T34/85 x 2, IS2, KV2, StuG III, Hetzer</b>

01:02:43.560 --> 01:02:47.850
<b>3. M4, M4/A1, Firefly, M3, Type 97 Shinhoto x 2, Kyuhoto x 3, Type 95</b>

01:02:44.400 --> 01:02:47.840
So, I want to split into three companies, like this.

01:02:48.100 --> 01:02:48.650
Okay!

01:02:48.600 --> 01:02:50.070
And the company commanders?

01:02:50.440 --> 01:02:53.370
Well, there's Onee-cha— Nishizumi Maho,

01:02:53.400 --> 01:02:55.190
Kay-san, and me.

01:02:55.190 --> 01:02:56.640
It's nothing but Westerners!

01:02:56.640 --> 01:02:57.280
Got a problem?

01:02:57.280 --> 01:02:58.800
Do you want to be a commander?

01:02:58.840 --> 01:03:00.790
Of course I'm the only one suitable!

01:03:02.210 --> 01:03:03.760
All right, maybe next time...

01:03:04.120 --> 01:03:06.320
Katyusha-san, you can be the second-in-command.

01:03:06.450 --> 01:03:09.200
Really? Can't be helped I guess, I'll do it!

01:03:09.320 --> 01:03:12.160
Darjeeling-san and Nishi-san, please take the seconds-in-command as well.

01:03:12.270 --> 01:03:12.970
That's fine.

01:03:13.140 --> 01:03:14.800
I'll do my absolute best!

01:03:14.960 --> 01:03:16.350
<b>CO: Commanding Officer</b>

01:03:14.960 --> 01:03:16.350
So the CO is Miho...

01:03:16.640 --> 01:03:17.910
We'll follow your lead!

01:03:18.200 --> 01:03:21.030
CO, please name our companies!

01:03:21.140 --> 01:03:22.500
Eh, then...

01:03:23.590 --> 01:03:25.480
The Nishizumi Maho team is "Sunflower",

01:03:25.840 --> 01:03:27.510
Kay-san's team is "Morning Glory",

01:03:27.900 --> 01:03:29.500
and we'll be "Dandelion," how's that?

01:03:29.650 --> 01:03:30.580
It's good enough.

01:03:30.740 --> 01:03:31.800
What's the combat plan?

01:03:32.160 --> 01:03:34.480
Marching fire is the only choice, isn't it?

01:03:34.500 --> 01:03:36.800
We'll keep moving and firing.

01:03:36.800 --> 01:03:39.410
We should break through the enemy lines!

01:03:39.490 --> 01:03:43.600
How about the doctrine of superior firepower? Attack one of theirs with ten of ours!

01:03:43.600 --> 01:03:44.890
Double envelopments, of course!

01:03:45.070 --> 01:03:47.810
Then we wait for General Winter to ally with us!

01:03:47.810 --> 01:03:49.900
Annihilation matches have no time limit anyway!

01:03:50.020 --> 01:03:52.280
I've considered multiple possibilities...

01:03:52.500 --> 01:03:54.110
And I feel like charging is the best option!

01:03:54.000 --> 01:03:56.530
Let's think about it after a round of pasta.

01:03:56.380 --> 01:03:58.720
<b>o General Winter
o Charge
o Pasta</b>

01:03:56.800 --> 01:03:58.610
You said you'd follow Miho's instructions.

01:03:59.090 --> 01:03:59.400
Miho?

01:03:59.660 --> 01:04:00.430
Um, yes.

01:04:00.800 --> 01:04:02.490
Sunflower team will be the main force

01:04:02.700 --> 01:04:05.280
while Morning Glory and Dandelion will fortify the flanks...

01:04:05.660 --> 01:04:09.300
Stay close so the teams can support each other, and don't wander off...

01:04:10.050 --> 01:04:12.470
Then, here's the most important part...

01:04:13.440 --> 01:04:14.930
What's the name of our operation?

01:04:14.930 --> 01:04:18.260
Since we're attacking from 3 directions,
"Operation Three Cheese Pizza"!

01:04:18.290 --> 01:04:20.080
"Operation Beef Stroganoff" is the best!

01:04:20.190 --> 01:04:23.290
Can't beat the combination of onions, beef and sour cream!

01:04:23.290 --> 01:04:26.320
Let's call it "Operation Fish and Chips and Vinegar".

01:04:26.320 --> 01:04:27.910
"Operation Glühwein und Eiswein"!

01:04:27.910 --> 01:04:30.450
"Operation Fried Chicken Steak with Gravy Sauce"!

01:04:30.590 --> 01:04:33.590
- "Operation Anglerfish, Dried Potato, and Clams"!
- Prez, don't join them!

01:04:33.780 --> 01:04:35.860
Let's compromise, how about "Operation Sukiyaki"?

01:04:35.990 --> 01:04:38.540
Your favorite food has nothing to do with the operation!

01:04:38.850 --> 01:04:40.230
Then what do you suggest?

01:04:42.060 --> 01:04:44.470
How's "Operation Meistersinger von Nürnberg"?

01:04:45.140 --> 01:04:47.140
- It's a three-act opera...
- It's too long!

01:04:48.100 --> 01:04:49.720
CO, please decide.

01:04:50.060 --> 01:04:52.450
How about "Operation Bumpy"?

01:04:53.000 --> 01:04:55.830
We look for the enemy, then we bump into them!

01:04:55.880 --> 01:04:57.800
What kind of name is that? It's not imposing at all.

01:04:58.170 --> 01:04:59.130
Let's go with that.

01:04:59.560 --> 01:05:01.420
"Bumpy"... I get it!

01:05:01.680 --> 01:05:02.300
It's pretty good!

01:05:02.500 --> 01:05:04.070
Then, Dandelion to the right flank...

01:05:04.470 --> 01:05:05.340
Morning Glory to the left flank...

01:05:05.760 --> 01:05:07.430
and Sunflower in the middle!

01:05:07.560 --> 01:05:08.100
Yes!

01:05:08.500 --> 01:05:10.250
Operation Bumpy, begin!

01:05:10.780 --> 01:05:12.000
Panzer vor!

01:05:13.080 --> 01:05:14.460
Orders, Commander?

01:05:15.030 --> 01:05:18.610
Even though they're just high schoolers, they can put up a good fight.

01:05:19.430 --> 01:05:22.650
First take out Pravda and Kuromorimine's heavy tanks.

01:05:23.310 --> 01:05:29.590
Azumi and Rumi's companies will stick with mine, pushing forward in a line.

01:05:30.120 --> 01:05:31.890
Be wary of enemy flanking movements.

01:05:32.550 --> 01:05:35.480
Recon tanks, hold your fire even when you spot an enemy.

01:05:35.640 --> 01:05:36.100
Understood!

01:05:36.740 --> 01:05:37.730
Everyone, forward!

01:05:37.800 --> 01:05:39.350
Rumi here, affirmative!

01:05:39.950 --> 01:05:42.550
Azumi, affirmative, moving forward.

01:05:42.920 --> 01:05:45.230
Megumi, company moving forward.

01:05:53.130 --> 01:05:55.120
It will take at least twenty minutes for us to reach the enemy.

01:06:29.450 --> 01:06:33.500
This is the CO's tank, we don't have confirmation of the enemy's movement.

01:06:33.780 --> 01:06:35.140
Please move carefully.

01:06:36.430 --> 01:06:39.290
Um, Duce, your twintail is blocking my view.

01:06:39.200 --> 01:06:42.770
This tank was for two people, now I can't see in front!

01:06:42.950 --> 01:06:44.230
Then get out, Pepperoni!

01:06:44.230 --> 01:06:46.550
- No way!
- Then stop complaining!

01:06:46.600 --> 01:06:48.560
Can't you take off the wig?

01:06:48.600 --> 01:06:49.380
This is real!

01:06:49.420 --> 01:06:51.270
- Really, huh?
- Ouch!

01:06:53.550 --> 01:06:54.140
I see them!

01:06:54.270 --> 01:06:55.200
Enemies spotted!

01:06:55.410 --> 01:06:57.150
Moving forward slowly in a line.

01:06:57.930 --> 01:06:58.620
Understood!

01:06:59.170 --> 01:07:01.970
CO, Sunflower team is currently at the valley of the hill.

01:07:02.200 --> 01:07:03.750
Forward troops on the move!

01:07:10.560 --> 01:07:12.650
I don't see any enemies on the hilltop!

01:07:12.740 --> 01:07:14.360
Then capture it immediately!

01:07:15.200 --> 01:07:16.790
CO, your orders?

01:07:17.240 --> 01:07:20.220
It might be a trap, so exercise caution.

01:07:20.700 --> 01:07:23.260
Make sure you have an escape route,
then spread out and move forward.

01:07:23.820 --> 01:07:26.780
If you see an enemy, don't push yourself by engaging.

01:07:27.310 --> 01:07:29.990
Capturing the hill is good, but our company might be flanked and split in two.

01:07:30.620 --> 01:07:32.910
Then we wouldn't be able to coordinate with the other companies.

01:07:33.450 --> 01:07:37.500
M26 isn't a good climber, we'll be fine.

01:07:37.840 --> 01:07:40.070
If we managed to take the high ground, it would be a tactical advantage.

01:07:40.430 --> 01:07:41.680
An advantage, sure...

01:07:42.250 --> 01:07:44.410
But it might be a trap.

01:07:44.810 --> 01:07:45.710
It's gonna be fine!

01:07:46.160 --> 01:07:49.530
In the end, you don't trust your little sister...

01:07:50.590 --> 01:07:53.130
Nonna trusts me completely!

01:07:53.750 --> 01:07:56.890
If I say that snow is black, she wouldn't dare to call it white!

01:07:57.240 --> 01:07:57.570
Right?

01:07:57.640 --> 01:07:58.000
Yes.

01:07:58.490 --> 01:08:00.540
Trust isn't the same as a cult of personality.

01:08:02.050 --> 01:08:05.200
Well, if the match drags on, it'll be advantageous to the more experienced side.

01:08:05.850 --> 01:08:08.020
Let's try and make some progress now.

01:08:08.390 --> 01:08:08.900
Yes!

01:08:12.600 --> 01:08:15.440
We're coming! 203 Hill!

01:08:15.770 --> 01:08:17.440
Oh? 203 Hill?

01:08:17.550 --> 01:08:19.610
Does Pravda know what kind of battle that was?

01:08:19.650 --> 01:08:20.700
Maybe she's planning on losing?

01:08:26.100 --> 01:08:29.270
Morning Glory, keep your formation. 
Sunflower, turn left.

01:08:29.430 --> 01:08:29.870
Okay!

01:08:30.160 --> 01:08:31.150
What about us?

01:08:31.520 --> 01:08:34.540
Dandelion, please move to the right edge of Sunflower's hill,

01:08:34.540 --> 01:08:36.070
and provide Sunflower cover from there.

01:08:36.500 --> 01:08:41.200
"Success is the son of bravery".
We're going to have a decisive battle from the start.

01:08:51.250 --> 01:08:52.250
Hey, Nina!

01:08:52.470 --> 01:08:54.070
So sorry!

01:08:56.550 --> 01:08:58.430
Enemy company, approaching the hill from the north!

01:08:58.840 --> 01:09:00.890
Estimated five minutes until they reach the top!

01:09:01.580 --> 01:09:02.280
Shall we attack?

01:09:03.040 --> 01:09:03.890
Let them have the hill.

01:09:07.850 --> 01:09:11.640
Azumi Company, please head to the forest west of the hill at full speed.

01:09:12.090 --> 01:09:16.890
If you see the enemy, break through, and flank behind of their central force.

01:09:17.240 --> 01:09:17.950
Understood.

01:09:18.130 --> 01:09:20.070
All company tanks, full speed ahead.

01:09:20.550 --> 01:09:23.800
Rumi Company, follow the eastern edge of the hill to the wetlands

01:09:24.120 --> 01:09:27.220
If you see the enemy, don't break through and tie their forces down.

01:09:28.240 --> 01:09:30.890
Company, switch formation from horizontal to diagonal!

01:09:35.000 --> 01:09:37.040
This is Arisa, nothing out of the ordinary ahead.

01:09:37.460 --> 01:09:37.960
Got it!

01:09:38.330 --> 01:09:40.130
Kay to Nishi, how are you guys doing?

01:09:40.590 --> 01:09:41.690
Chihatan troops here.

01:09:42.030 --> 01:09:45.130
We're moving forward with no problem, we don't see enemies on our right.

01:09:46.600 --> 01:09:48.010
Enemy at three-o'clock!

01:09:51.140 --> 01:09:53.380
CQ, CQ! Morning Glory under attack!

01:09:56.060 --> 01:09:58.490
Darjeeling here, enemy spotted.

01:09:59.830 --> 01:10:02.270
At ten-o'clock, distance 240 yards.

01:10:04.220 --> 01:10:06.990
Dandelion, reverse slowly while attacking.

01:10:07.400 --> 01:10:10.250
They're coming to destroy Dandelion and Morning Glory first!

01:10:12.790 --> 01:10:14.500
Eleven-o'clock, Pershings!

01:10:17.540 --> 01:10:18.690
Number of hostiles increasing!

01:10:18.850 --> 01:10:20.260
Miho-san, your orders?

01:10:20.870 --> 01:10:23.220
CO to Morning Glory and Dandelion.

01:10:23.760 --> 01:10:27.560
Move out of the enemy's firing range.

01:10:27.690 --> 01:10:30.170
Hang in there until Sunflower reaches the hill.

01:10:30.620 --> 01:10:33.620
Nishi-san, try not to do any pointless charges!

01:10:33.860 --> 01:10:35.880
Um, yes, understood!

01:10:43.290 --> 01:10:44.110
Sunflower here.

01:10:44.620 --> 01:10:45.860
We are at the hilltop.

01:10:46.040 --> 01:10:47.430
203 Hill captured!

01:10:47.620 --> 01:10:48.760
Ura!

01:10:48.810 --> 01:10:49.390
Miporin!

01:10:49.390 --> 01:10:50.460
We did it!

01:10:50.510 --> 01:10:51.920
Sunflower, split into two forces.

01:10:52.170 --> 01:10:54.560
Support Morning Glory and Dandelion from your high positions.

01:10:55.030 --> 01:10:55.470
Understood.

01:10:55.870 --> 01:10:59.030
Enemies spotted to the north, we will give supporting fire while being on alert.

01:10:59.350 --> 01:11:00.450
Time to attack!

01:11:16.150 --> 01:11:17.080
They're here!

01:11:17.200 --> 01:11:18.590
Don't let them through!

01:11:18.990 --> 01:11:19.510
Fire!

01:11:23.010 --> 01:11:24.370
Arisa, Naomi, Rabbit team!

01:11:24.580 --> 01:11:25.170
Yes!

01:11:25.370 --> 01:11:27.190
They're gonna break through at Chihatan's flanks

01:11:27.360 --> 01:11:28.890
Move forward and defend!

01:11:29.040 --> 01:11:30.300
Got it! I—

01:11:31.250 --> 01:11:32.270
They've concentrated their fire!

01:11:32.360 --> 01:11:33.360
Can't move!

01:11:33.410 --> 01:11:34.650
Can't provide support! Can't provide support!

01:11:34.920 --> 01:11:35.280
Shit!

01:11:35.540 --> 01:11:37.100
Damn, charge!

01:11:37.160 --> 01:11:38.180
We're not gonna lose!

01:11:38.230 --> 01:11:40.030
Hey, it's too early for a charge!

01:11:52.620 --> 01:11:55.310
Ikeda tank here, it's shameful, we got hit and can't move!

01:11:55.380 --> 01:11:57.800
Nagura tank here, we fought bravely but got knocked out!

01:11:57.860 --> 01:12:00.060
One new and one old Type 97 knocked out

01:12:00.470 --> 01:12:01.920
It's shameful!

01:12:03.140 --> 01:12:04.270
Morning Glory to Sunflower!

01:12:04.550 --> 01:12:06.730
Enemies have broken through, we're giving chase!

01:12:06.990 --> 01:12:09.190
Arisa, take charge of the chase.

01:12:09.280 --> 01:12:09.920
Yes ma'am!

01:12:10.090 --> 01:12:11.620
If your tank can move, follow me!

01:12:26.140 --> 01:12:30.350
Both tracks damaged! Turret damaged! Transmission damaged!

01:12:28.850 --> 01:12:30.350
Get back into formation, hurry up!

01:12:30.690 --> 01:12:34.760
The forces on the left have broken through Morning Glory, and are closing in on our rear.

01:12:35.000 --> 01:12:37.820
Prepare to support Morning Glory, let's destroy them!

01:12:38.470 --> 01:12:39.480
Are you ready?

01:12:39.630 --> 01:12:40.730
Ready!

01:12:40.730 --> 01:12:41.860
At firing position!

01:12:42.090 --> 01:12:43.540
Company Commander, is this fine?

01:12:43.800 --> 01:12:44.830
Permission to attack granted.

01:12:45.880 --> 01:12:46.640
Fire!

01:12:50.020 --> 01:12:51.080
A bomb!?

01:12:51.140 --> 01:12:52.380
- What's going on?
- What's happening?

01:12:54.240 --> 01:12:55.750
Hey, Sunflower here.

01:12:55.870 --> 01:12:57.410
Feels like it came from the sky!

01:12:57.540 --> 01:13:00.360
I feel like it's a huge one, or am I imagining things?

01:13:00.360 --> 01:13:01.840
You're not imagining things!

01:13:01.840 --> 01:13:03.790
It's gotta be this, Brummbär assault gun!

01:13:03.790 --> 01:13:05.550
This is way too strong...

01:13:05.990 --> 01:13:08.410
Maybe it's a Sturmtiger!

01:13:08.650 --> 01:13:11.340
What is that, a human shell?

01:13:11.340 --> 01:13:12.810
It's a 380mm shell!

01:13:27.480 --> 01:13:29.340
Panther #1 knocked out!

01:13:29.340 --> 01:13:30.710
Panther #2 immobile!

01:13:30.710 --> 01:13:32.510
Move forward before the third attack!

01:13:34.920 --> 01:13:36.690
Enemies ahead! They've begun firing!

01:13:36.690 --> 01:13:37.110
Pull back!

01:13:38.000 --> 01:13:39.510
It's a waste, but we're pulling back!

01:13:42.390 --> 01:13:44.310
No way, pull back!

01:13:44.500 --> 01:13:45.510
Oh? Could it be?

01:13:45.700 --> 01:13:46.540
We're surrounded!

01:13:48.530 --> 01:13:50.050
A half-encirclement from the rear...

01:13:50.370 --> 01:13:51.700
Mysterious bombings from the sky...

01:13:52.010 --> 01:13:53.490
And the enemy main force ahead...

01:13:53.570 --> 01:13:54.950
We'll be annihilated if we stay here!

01:13:54.980 --> 01:13:56.810
Commander, think of something! We're gonna get knocked out!

01:13:56.810 --> 01:13:58.150
We're not knocked out yet!

01:13:58.230 --> 01:13:59.790
We will drive down the hill at full speed.

01:14:00.270 --> 01:14:01.470
Company, full speed ahead!

01:14:01.690 --> 01:14:02.860
Regroup with Dandelion!

01:14:23.520 --> 01:14:26.420
See? You can't hit me like this!

01:14:26.420 --> 01:14:27.300
Pershings, closing in!

01:14:28.690 --> 01:14:30.080
What? Firing at me!?

01:14:38.650 --> 01:14:40.150
Katyusha is in danger!

01:14:38.650 --> 01:14:40.150
Катюша в опасности!
Katyusha v opasnosti!

01:14:40.230 --> 01:14:42.280
We'll break through together!

01:14:40.230 --> 01:14:42.280
Мы прорвемся, все вместе
My prorvemsya, vse vmeste

01:14:42.490 --> 01:14:44.240
We can't break through together.

01:14:42.490 --> 01:14:44.240
Все вместе навряд ли
Vse vmeste navryad li

01:14:44.450 --> 01:14:45.950
We'll be the bait!

01:14:44.450 --> 01:14:45.950
Мы стоим приманкой!
My stoim primankoy!

01:14:47.200 --> 01:14:49.240
Klara, don't be ridiculous!

01:14:47.200 --> 01:14:49.240
Клара, не делай глупости!
Klara, ne delay gluposti!

01:14:49.330 --> 01:14:52.500
If you do this, Katyusha won't like it!

01:14:49.330 --> 01:14:52.500
Если ты сделаешь это, Катюша тебя разлюбит
Yesli ty sdelayesh' eto, Katyusha tebya razlyubit

01:14:52.660 --> 01:14:55.540
If we can break through, then it is worth it!

01:14:52.660 --> 01:14:55.540
Если мы прорвемся, то разлюбит это не важно
Yesli my prorvemsya, to razlyubit eto ne vazhno

01:14:56.070 --> 01:14:59.990
How many times do I have to say it? Speak Japanese!

01:15:00.320 --> 01:15:00.610
Eh?

01:15:01.140 --> 01:15:03.320
Katyusha-sama, please go on ahead.

01:15:03.740 --> 01:15:05.260
Good luck to you!

01:15:05.700 --> 01:15:07.790
What's with your fluent Japanese?

01:15:08.100 --> 01:15:09.960
Klara speaks excellent Japanese.

01:15:10.090 --> 01:15:11.800
You should have told me earlier!

01:15:12.980 --> 01:15:13.930
What is she going to do?

01:15:14.070 --> 01:15:14.760
Klara?

01:15:16.070 --> 01:15:16.690
Klara!

01:15:18.070 --> 01:15:21.490
Katyusha-sama, it was an honor to fight beside you!

01:15:21.490 --> 01:15:22.170
Klara!

01:15:22.320 --> 01:15:24.030
For Pravda!

01:15:22.320 --> 01:15:24.030
За Правду!
Za Pravdu!

01:15:26.900 --> 01:15:27.750
Klara!

01:15:30.000 --> 01:15:32.200
They're aiming for Katyusha-sama again!

01:15:32.290 --> 01:15:35.900
That little Commander is reckless...

01:15:36.160 --> 01:15:38.160
But if we're defeated here...

01:15:38.360 --> 01:15:41.800
Our tank is big enough to become a shield, right?

01:15:42.210 --> 01:15:43.050
Wanna go?

01:15:43.180 --> 01:15:43.780
Yes!

01:15:44.090 --> 01:15:46.280
Let's go! Everyone, aye?

01:15:46.430 --> 01:15:47.320
Aye, we should do it!

01:15:47.320 --> 01:15:48.440
We should do it!

01:15:50.520 --> 01:15:51.510
KV-tan?

01:15:53.630 --> 01:15:54.330
Not so fast!

01:15:54.330 --> 01:15:55.510
Fire as quickly as you can!

01:15:57.690 --> 01:16:00.430
Don't underestimate the monster!

01:16:04.650 --> 01:16:05.060
Not good!

01:16:05.600 --> 01:16:06.910
Katyusha, get out of here!

01:16:07.080 --> 01:16:08.770
I'm not a good Commander if I run away!

01:16:08.950 --> 01:16:09.720
Please!

01:16:09.820 --> 01:16:10.490
Not you too!

01:16:10.750 --> 01:16:12.700
I can't lose Nonna!

01:16:12.970 --> 01:16:15.430
You are an important person in this match!

01:16:15.650 --> 01:16:17.920
You have ambitions higher than the Ural Mountains...

01:16:18.000 --> 01:16:20.060
And wisdom deeper than Lake Baikal!

01:16:20.820 --> 01:16:22.520
So please pull back!

01:16:36.470 --> 01:16:37.180
Now!

01:16:39.280 --> 01:16:43.450
Katyusha, even when I'm gone, you'll...

01:16:45.670 --> 01:16:46.620
Definitely win!

01:16:55.760 --> 01:16:56.650
N-Nonna...

01:16:56.940 --> 01:16:58.090
Katyusha, what are you doing?

01:16:58.570 --> 01:16:59.670
Katyusha-sama!

01:16:59.740 --> 01:17:01.050
Hurry up and go!

01:17:02.130 --> 01:17:02.970
We're...

01:17:03.810 --> 01:17:04.920
Pulling back!

01:17:12.090 --> 01:17:14.090
Ooarai KV-2, immobile!

01:17:14.260 --> 01:17:18.580
1 Type 97, 1 Shinhoto, 2 Panthers...

01:17:18.680 --> 01:17:23.140
1 T-34, 1 IS-2, 1 KV-2 knocked out!

01:17:25.010 --> 01:17:26.020
Nishi here.

01:17:26.030 --> 01:17:29.150
The force that broke through Morning Glory have stopped engaging Sunflower,

01:17:29.150 --> 01:17:30.810
and is regrouping with their main force.

01:17:30.810 --> 01:17:32.980
Understood, please continue your recon.

01:17:34.080 --> 01:17:36.920
But that artillery from the sky is...

01:17:37.330 --> 01:17:38.880
Probably "that"...

01:17:39.110 --> 01:17:40.360
"That"? No way...

01:17:40.730 --> 01:17:41.850
Why'd she know about it?

01:17:41.910 --> 01:17:42.850
Did she eavesdrop again?

01:17:43.210 --> 01:17:45.980
Feels like she'll eavesdrop on her boyfriend as well.

01:17:45.980 --> 01:17:46.800
She's too harsh!

01:17:47.030 --> 01:17:49.030
That's probably why she got dumped by Takeshi!

01:17:49.110 --> 01:17:51.700
I didn't even confess, how could I be dumped?

01:17:51.990 --> 01:17:53.530
How did you guys know about it anyway?

01:17:53.630 --> 01:17:55.710
Arisa, cheer up!

01:17:55.760 --> 01:17:57.050
It's okay to be alone as well!

01:17:57.210 --> 01:17:57.710
Try your best!

01:17:57.810 --> 01:17:58.350
Don't mind!

01:17:58.440 --> 01:18:00.440
It's good to think of your tank as your lover!

01:18:00.450 --> 01:18:03.220
Shut it! I don't need to be comforted by you guys!

01:18:03.360 --> 01:18:05.960
Anyway, "that thing" was approved?

01:18:06.130 --> 01:18:09.550
We wanted to buy it once, so we asked about it, but it was still under discussion back then...

01:18:09.740 --> 01:18:12.350
Sunflower has broken through, but they only have five tanks left.

01:18:12.580 --> 01:18:15.110
Should we stop engaging and regroup with Sunflower?

01:18:15.580 --> 01:18:18.790
But first we gotta deal with the artillery.

01:18:19.270 --> 01:18:21.980
Judging from the sound of firing and explosions...

01:18:22.210 --> 01:18:24.940
The shell should weigh more than a ton, something like a naval gun.

01:18:25.050 --> 01:18:28.530
But it made no noise like a rocket propeller, so it's not a Sturmtiger...

01:18:29.290 --> 01:18:30.180
Then that would be...

01:18:30.340 --> 01:18:30.660
Yeah.

01:18:31.980 --> 01:18:36.310
President, Isobe-san, Anchovy-san, and Mika-san, I have a favor to ask...

01:18:36.400 --> 01:18:39.660
Acorn Platoon, full speed ahead!

01:18:40.390 --> 01:18:41.610
Sorry for the wait, Chovy!

01:18:41.730 --> 01:18:42.980
Don't call me Chovy!

01:18:43.730 --> 01:18:45.310
Four tanks are approaching.

01:18:45.840 --> 01:18:47.550
They're probably going after the Command Tank...

01:18:48.100 --> 01:18:50.240
Are they trying to disrupt our chain of command?

01:18:50.570 --> 01:18:51.650
Or maybe it's a suicide charge?

01:18:52.450 --> 01:18:55.530
Everyone, fire! Don't let them get close to the Commander

01:18:59.690 --> 01:19:00.320
They're disappeared?

01:19:01.060 --> 01:19:02.730
It's a feint, ignore them.

01:19:06.860 --> 01:19:09.730
Huh, what is that!?

01:19:09.980 --> 01:19:11.350
It's a Karl!

01:19:12.350 --> 01:19:13.520
Karl Wolff?

01:19:13.520 --> 01:19:14.240
No!

01:19:14.400 --> 01:19:15.940
Then Karl what?

01:19:15.940 --> 01:19:17.650
Karl self-propelled siege mortar!

01:19:17.880 --> 01:19:19.600
That's a 600mm gun!

01:19:19.600 --> 01:19:21.020
600!?

01:19:21.520 --> 01:19:25.420
CV-33 has an 8mm MG, so how many times that?

01:19:25.430 --> 01:19:28.500
Can't you do division? It's 7.5 times!

01:19:28.500 --> 01:19:29.780
It's 75 times!

01:19:37.330 --> 01:19:42.360
The sudden decision to approve this weapon...
was made for this match, wasn't it?

01:19:42.550 --> 01:19:44.440
Please don't try and find excuses.

01:19:44.730 --> 01:19:48.320
Is it really okay to include an open-top weapon as a "tank"?

01:19:48.870 --> 01:19:50.510
It's just a matter of perspective.

01:19:53.560 --> 01:19:55.770
Three Pershings are protecting the Karl!

01:19:55.950 --> 01:19:57.430
Prez! Let's pull back!

01:19:58.250 --> 01:19:59.570
Let's attack it with our four tanks.

01:19:59.570 --> 01:20:00.470
That's too reckless!

01:20:00.680 --> 01:20:02.980
It's as reckless as eating pasta raw!

01:20:03.060 --> 01:20:04.400
We can only retreat!

01:20:04.570 --> 01:20:06.610
Wait a minute, I have an idea!

01:20:06.690 --> 01:20:08.630
Are we getting on top of it again?

01:20:08.630 --> 01:20:09.380
That's a pretty good idea!

01:20:09.380 --> 01:20:10.100
No it isn't!

01:20:10.100 --> 01:20:12.000
We can't get on top of the Karl, but...

01:20:12.000 --> 01:20:13.440
Our plan is...

01:20:13.640 --> 01:20:15.260
"Operation Kill Serve"!

01:20:15.420 --> 01:20:16.460
The details are...

01:20:16.750 --> 01:20:18.480
Why you little—!

01:20:18.480 --> 01:20:20.610
Rosehip, come back.

01:20:20.710 --> 01:20:23.030
- The plan feels pretty good!
- Are you sure?

01:20:23.310 --> 01:20:25.060
Continuation-chan! Can you hear me?

01:20:25.170 --> 01:20:26.880
I need your help here.

01:20:28.530 --> 01:20:30.670
I think this plan is pointless.

01:20:30.920 --> 01:20:32.390
Then, are you gonna ignore their orders?

01:20:35.110 --> 01:20:37.310
But I trust their decision.

01:20:54.030 --> 01:20:54.480
Let's go!

01:21:14.920 --> 01:21:16.000
Platoon, give chase!

01:21:17.780 --> 01:21:20.440
Is this one of the essential battles of life that we must go through?

01:21:21.030 --> 01:21:21.820
Probably.

01:21:27.800 --> 01:21:28.460
Now!

01:21:34.650 --> 01:21:35.480
Oh no!

01:21:36.100 --> 01:21:38.620
No problem, I'll blow them to smithereens!

01:21:41.020 --> 01:21:42.950
It's aiming at us!

01:22:03.290 --> 01:22:04.290
One tank left!

01:22:04.460 --> 01:22:05.510
Mikko, on your left!

01:22:25.680 --> 01:22:27.630
What? But their tracks are gone!

01:22:31.380 --> 01:22:34.320
Don't underestimate the BT-42's Christie suspension!

01:22:35.780 --> 01:22:38.620
Go!

01:22:40.300 --> 01:22:41.090
Sure-kill!

01:22:41.590 --> 01:22:44.440
Kill Serve!

01:22:45.590 --> 01:22:46.170
We did it!

01:22:46.330 --> 01:22:48.300
We're too smart!

01:22:48.340 --> 01:22:51.320
Now! Aim for the muzzle!

01:22:57.270 --> 01:22:57.750
Eh?

01:23:01.540 --> 01:23:02.060
Ready up!

01:23:10.500 --> 01:23:12.560
It was tough making that jump!

01:23:12.560 --> 01:23:14.210
- The operation is a failure! Please pull back!
- Damn!

01:23:14.310 --> 01:23:15.980
Chovy, hurry up and fix the tracks!

01:23:15.980 --> 01:23:18.340
Don't boss me around! Who do you think I am!?

01:23:18.340 --> 01:23:20.860
I'll make you potato pasta afterwards.

01:23:20.860 --> 01:23:21.590
Pasta!

01:23:21.590 --> 01:23:22.420
Really?

01:23:25.480 --> 01:23:26.150
Yes!

01:23:29.210 --> 01:23:30.530
Fly!

01:23:32.930 --> 01:23:34.860
Prez! Its all yours!

01:23:43.330 --> 01:23:44.120
Done!

01:24:08.800 --> 01:24:09.330
Tulta!

01:24:18.560 --> 01:24:20.280
I wish everyone the best of luck!

01:24:23.300 --> 01:24:26.590
BT-42, two Panthers, T-34,

01:24:26.730 --> 01:24:30.020
IS-2, KV-2, an old Type 97 and a new one:

01:24:30.280 --> 01:24:32.260
A total of 8 tanks knocked out.

01:24:32.500 --> 01:24:35.890
But, but we knocked out Karl and five Pershings!

01:24:36.320 --> 01:24:38.930
This makes it 22 to 24!

01:24:39.370 --> 01:24:40.580
We've lost so many...

01:24:40.630 --> 01:24:42.720
No, it's good that we've held for this long.

01:24:43.100 --> 01:24:45.220
Thanks to everyone from Continuation!

01:24:45.380 --> 01:24:46.120
And us!

01:24:46.210 --> 01:24:47.460
Of course!

01:24:47.460 --> 01:24:50.070
It's thanks to the Volleyball team and President!

01:24:50.250 --> 01:24:53.730
Nishizumi-san, two of our tanks were knocked out.

01:24:53.900 --> 01:24:55.580
I am very sorry for that!

01:24:55.930 --> 01:24:56.660
It's all right...

01:24:56.930 --> 01:24:59.310
I'm the only one left...

01:24:59.380 --> 01:25:00.180
It's gonna be all right.

01:25:00.810 --> 01:25:03.300
At least you're here, Katyusha.

01:25:03.670 --> 01:25:04.830
I know!

01:25:06.380 --> 01:25:08.560
I'm sorry, it was my fault.

01:25:08.790 --> 01:25:10.750
I thought we could fight on equal ground.

01:25:10.980 --> 01:25:12.490
You're going by the book too much.

01:25:13.090 --> 01:25:13.750
This isn't like you.

01:25:15.330 --> 01:25:16.980
Just fight according to your own style.

01:25:18.230 --> 01:25:20.490
CO, please tell us your next order.

01:25:20.900 --> 01:25:23.700
We'll fight a limited war, and the schools should fight according to their styles...

01:25:23.700 --> 01:25:25.120
We'll fight cooperatively.

01:25:25.620 --> 01:25:27.700
Cooperating as a makeshift team?

01:25:27.790 --> 01:25:29.800
A makeshift team is still a team.

01:25:30.300 --> 01:25:33.250
We'll just have to supplement what the other lacks and fight.

01:25:33.560 --> 01:25:35.780
We'll reassign teams, and then head to our destination.

01:25:35.870 --> 01:25:36.390
Okay!

01:25:36.600 --> 01:25:38.980
Over there, encounter battles will become easier for us.

01:25:39.080 --> 01:25:39.950
That is true.

01:25:40.070 --> 01:25:41.840
But that place would also be our last stand!

01:25:42.020 --> 01:25:44.090
We are good at these kind of battles!

01:25:44.090 --> 01:25:45.310
Same for Anzio!

01:25:45.350 --> 01:25:46.160
Is that so?

01:25:46.410 --> 01:25:48.880
Then, Panzer vor!

01:26:07.430 --> 01:26:09.940
I didn't think we would retreat to such a desolate place...

01:26:10.320 --> 01:26:11.240
No, Tamada!

01:26:11.380 --> 01:26:12.320
This is simply a strategic redeployment!

01:26:12.440 --> 01:26:14.090
I see, a strategic redeployment!

01:26:16.750 --> 01:26:18.840
This is shaping up to be an interesting battle.

01:26:19.080 --> 01:26:22.560
All due respect, but according to the data this is shaping up to be a tough battle...

01:26:22.830 --> 01:26:24.360
We are ready for it.

01:26:24.790 --> 01:26:26.080
"Destiny is unfaithful".

01:26:26.500 --> 01:26:28.410
The disadvantaged side might not always be the one that loses.

01:26:28.930 --> 01:26:30.000
Right, Commander?

01:26:30.340 --> 01:26:30.980
Yes.

01:26:31.730 --> 01:26:34.820
Let us all do our best and fight according to our abilities!

01:26:42.340 --> 01:26:44.000
Our own abilities...

01:26:44.210 --> 01:26:44.880
What kind of ability?

01:26:45.320 --> 01:26:46.150
Charge?

01:26:46.670 --> 01:26:47.430
No, that's not right...

01:26:50.360 --> 01:26:52.360
Everyone, move toward the theme park.

01:27:08.600 --> 01:27:10.770
Southern main gate, deployment complete!

01:27:11.140 --> 01:27:13.190
Western back gate, deployment is also complete!

01:27:13.490 --> 01:27:15.890
Eastern utility gate, deployment done.

01:27:15.960 --> 01:27:18.840
We'll finish the deployment at the central plaza in three minutes!

01:27:18.890 --> 01:27:20.520
Duce, for real?

01:27:20.690 --> 01:27:21.330
Yeah!

01:27:21.570 --> 01:27:23.050
Won't we be spotted?

01:27:23.050 --> 01:27:25.050
A tankette won't be spotted so easily.

01:27:25.050 --> 01:27:27.280
But if we are, there will be no way to run...

01:27:32.090 --> 01:27:34.150
Enemies amassing at the southern main gate!

01:27:34.520 --> 01:27:36.180
They're trying to break through in a straight line.

01:27:36.440 --> 01:27:38.830
First formation, please hurry to the southern main gate.

01:27:39.300 --> 01:27:41.530
Everyone at the northern back gate and eastern utility gate...

01:27:41.720 --> 01:27:43.510
Please stay alert!

01:27:43.880 --> 01:27:45.170
Everyone from Saunders, please wait for my orders!

01:27:45.540 --> 01:27:46.800
There are about three more minutes...

01:27:47.240 --> 01:27:50.250
They're going really fast!

01:27:50.680 --> 01:27:53.300
They are going fast on purpose to stir up the dust.

01:27:53.440 --> 01:27:55.520
They probably wanted to look imposing.

01:27:55.920 --> 01:27:57.510
It's some sort of trick...

01:27:57.700 --> 01:27:59.910
Just like our "Operation Macaroni"...

01:28:00.160 --> 01:28:01.270
I don't think that's the same thing.

01:28:03.180 --> 01:28:04.040
Get ready for combat!

01:28:04.400 --> 01:28:06.000
They're coming! Everyone keep a cool head.

01:28:13.540 --> 01:28:13.980
Fire!

01:28:21.720 --> 01:28:23.860
Damn, I can't see anything...

01:28:24.120 --> 01:28:27.230
I'm jealous! I want to fight on the field!

01:28:27.270 --> 01:28:30.100
It's strange though, the rain has just stopped...

01:28:30.100 --> 01:28:31.280
But there's so much dust...

01:28:42.370 --> 01:28:43.970
That's no dust!

01:28:44.460 --> 01:28:45.620
Damn it, we got tricked!

01:28:46.500 --> 01:28:48.030
Commander, it's a diversion!

01:28:48.030 --> 01:28:49.460
The dust is a smoke screen!

01:28:49.540 --> 01:28:52.120
It's the sixth stratagem:
"Make a sound in the east, then strike in the west"

01:28:52.180 --> 01:28:53.250
Stratagem?

01:28:53.460 --> 01:28:56.100
Nishi at the western back gate, the enemy is trying to get through there...

01:28:56.200 --> 01:28:58.320
People from Saunders are coming to your aid...

01:28:58.370 --> 01:28:59.680
Get ready for combat!

01:28:59.890 --> 01:29:00.800
Understood!

01:29:00.960 --> 01:29:03.960
All right! We charge at full speed once we see an enemy!

01:29:04.050 --> 01:29:07.600
- It's time to regain honor!
- Chihatan's special mass charge!

01:29:07.600 --> 01:29:09.120
Excuse me!

01:29:09.480 --> 01:29:11.520
If we charge recklessly and get ourselves eliminated...

01:29:11.640 --> 01:29:14.070
That's the real shameful thing to do!

01:29:14.070 --> 01:29:14.710
What are you talking about!?

01:29:14.710 --> 01:29:16.930
Fukuda, are you looking down on our traditions!?

01:29:16.980 --> 01:29:18.400
I'm sorry!

01:29:18.460 --> 01:29:19.210
Hold on

01:29:19.800 --> 01:29:21.890
Fukuda, do you have some kind of plan?

01:29:27.910 --> 01:29:30.190
Chaffee, let's have an exhilarating duel!

01:29:34.690 --> 01:29:35.760
Come back, Rosehip!

01:29:52.600 --> 01:29:53.510
What the heck?

01:29:53.680 --> 01:29:55.460
They have a T28 heavy tank!

01:29:55.800 --> 01:29:57.630
Which one is a T28?

01:29:57.840 --> 01:29:58.560
This one?

01:29:58.860 --> 01:30:00.870
It's a heavy tank, so probably this one...

01:30:02.050 --> 01:30:04.820
We should have brought a Tortoise...

01:30:04.800 --> 01:30:05.970
But we don't have one...

01:30:06.190 --> 01:30:07.110
Duce here!

01:30:07.220 --> 01:30:09.530
I'm sure this is the enemy's main force

01:30:09.670 --> 01:30:12.420
Saunders, please help out at the eastern utility gate!

01:30:12.470 --> 01:30:13.650
Already on the move!

01:30:13.810 --> 01:30:15.210
Ooarai teams, please head there too

01:30:15.210 --> 01:30:18.380
- I want a T28 conversion kit...
- They don't sell those!

01:30:18.810 --> 01:30:20.270
Looks like a Jabberwocky...

01:30:20.370 --> 01:30:22.160
More like a Bandersnatch...

01:30:29.290 --> 01:30:30.280
Sorry for the wait!

01:30:30.280 --> 01:30:31.180
Wow, it's huge!

01:30:36.240 --> 01:30:37.360
Get away from Zone 2.

01:30:44.090 --> 01:30:45.420
This is Megumi's company.

01:30:45.540 --> 01:30:46.970
We've broken through the eastern utility gate.

01:30:47.110 --> 01:30:49.120
Heading to Point Z according to the plan.

01:30:49.300 --> 01:30:49.820
Got it.

01:30:50.240 --> 01:30:52.250
Commander Nishi! Our comrades are in danger!

01:30:52.400 --> 01:30:54.440
Should we get there and charge the enemy?

01:30:54.540 --> 01:30:55.870
Don't say that, Tamada!

01:30:56.120 --> 01:30:57.010
This is part of the plan, too!

01:30:59.030 --> 01:31:00.540
Just 4 tanks...

01:31:00.960 --> 01:31:03.290
It's like they're only here to draw our attention...

01:31:03.560 --> 01:31:04.160
What should we do?

01:31:04.500 --> 01:31:05.760
Got it, we'll go.

01:31:06.200 --> 01:31:06.950
Please, Erika!

01:31:07.810 --> 01:31:08.200
Yes!

01:31:30.480 --> 01:31:31.430
No hostiles spotted.

01:31:39.750 --> 01:31:41.280
No hostiles on the other side of the shore, either.

01:31:49.010 --> 01:31:49.720
Enemy spotted!

01:31:58.200 --> 01:31:59.120
Nicely done! Now!

01:32:02.300 --> 01:32:03.520
Tamada, good job!

01:32:03.660 --> 01:32:04.830
All right, one more shot!

01:32:04.830 --> 01:32:06.070
That's enough!

01:32:06.920 --> 01:32:07.480
Come back here!

01:32:08.490 --> 01:32:10.070
Bastard!

01:32:11.830 --> 01:32:13.140
"Retreating Attack"!

01:32:16.850 --> 01:32:19.530
Their goal is to disrupt our formation with their firepower

01:32:19.650 --> 01:32:20.780
and take us out one-by-one!

01:32:20.780 --> 01:32:22.340
We're not gonna split up because of them!

01:32:23.230 --> 01:32:25.510
This is the southern main gate unit, we're retreating to the north!

01:32:25.640 --> 01:32:27.680
This is the western back gate unit, track repair completed!

01:32:27.940 --> 01:32:30.060
The enemy is unexpectedly defending in depth

01:32:30.220 --> 01:32:31.540
and we plan to resort to guerrilla tactics!

01:32:31.990 --> 01:32:33.330
We're changing tactics.

01:32:33.960 --> 01:32:36.100
If they refuse to split up, then let them.

01:32:36.290 --> 01:32:37.170
- Understood!
- Understood!

01:32:37.760 --> 01:32:39.890
Commander Nishi, is it time yet?

01:32:39.970 --> 01:32:40.660
Not yet...

01:32:40.660 --> 01:32:42.150
I think it's about time...

01:32:42.280 --> 01:32:42.970
Not yet!

01:32:43.010 --> 01:32:44.850
I am already at my limit!

01:32:44.850 --> 01:32:47.830
Hey, quit moving! The balloons are delicate!

01:32:48.760 --> 01:32:50.930
Crap! "Retreating Attack"!

01:32:56.470 --> 01:32:56.870
Here it comes!

01:32:56.870 --> 01:32:57.570
Run!

01:32:57.800 --> 01:32:59.090
Wait, not that way!

01:32:59.090 --> 01:33:00.640
Take care! We're being flanked!

01:33:00.680 --> 01:33:01.980
Run into the alleys to the west!

01:33:02.100 --> 01:33:03.830
Drive counterclockwise at the dome plaza in front!

01:33:03.730 --> 01:33:04.120
Yes!

01:33:04.120 --> 01:33:05.200
Which way is the west?

01:33:05.200 --> 01:33:06.200
I don't know!

01:33:13.040 --> 01:33:14.130
This is the front gate team.

01:33:14.300 --> 01:33:16.600
Judging from the way the Chaffee moves, the enemy probably has an ambush somewhere near...

01:33:16.690 --> 01:33:18.140
Keep that in mind, utility gate team.

01:33:19.220 --> 01:33:22.100
Feels like they have spotted us, but they're ignoring us...

01:33:22.100 --> 01:33:22.930
Am I imagining things?

01:33:23.040 --> 01:33:24.000
This is the rear guard.

01:33:24.190 --> 01:33:25.930
Their attack seems dispersed...

01:33:26.390 --> 01:33:27.110
It's strange.

01:33:33.320 --> 01:33:36.850
Excellent! They're knocking out Pershings left and right!

01:33:37.000 --> 01:33:38.260
Everyone is doing their best!

01:33:38.530 --> 01:33:40.200
It will take more than that to win.

01:33:40.290 --> 01:33:43.000
Why do you always say strange stuff like that?

01:33:43.180 --> 01:33:44.200
Just wait and see.

01:33:46.090 --> 01:33:47.700
This is bad, isn't it?

01:33:47.760 --> 01:33:48.440
Miporin!

01:33:48.550 --> 01:33:49.400
Crap!

01:33:49.460 --> 01:33:50.390
Not there, not there!

01:33:50.390 --> 01:33:51.780
Going that way won't work!

01:33:51.930 --> 01:33:55.760
Nishizumi, the utility gate team is about to be encircled at point YO!

01:33:55.960 --> 01:33:57.730
Got it, I'll head there to help immediately.

01:33:57.880 --> 01:33:59.810
Southern main gate team, west back gate team:

01:33:59.880 --> 01:34:01.300
Please head to point YO immediately!

01:34:01.530 --> 01:34:02.790
We are headed there as well...

01:34:03.010 --> 01:34:04.790
Please stop the enemy encirclement!

01:34:04.890 --> 01:34:05.400
Understood!

01:34:05.660 --> 01:34:06.420
We got tricked!

01:34:06.420 --> 01:34:08.060
They're gonna regroup

01:34:08.150 --> 01:34:10.040
That's why there was nobody here the whole time!

01:34:10.470 --> 01:34:11.390
What should we do...

01:34:25.200 --> 01:34:27.060
Go! Drive a wedge into the enemy lines!

01:34:47.110 --> 01:34:48.150
Encirclement complete.

01:34:48.180 --> 01:34:50.090
This match is so one-sided, it breaks my heart.

01:34:50.340 --> 01:34:52.310
Leave the rest to us!

01:34:53.750 --> 01:34:55.040
I don't really get what's happening, but...

01:34:55.210 --> 01:34:57.430
Our senpais are being surrounded, aren't they...?

01:34:57.430 --> 01:34:58.080
Not good!

01:34:58.120 --> 01:35:00.000
We'll charge and destroy the enemies!

01:35:00.000 --> 01:35:01.220
It's impossible with just our tank!

01:35:01.220 --> 01:35:02.360
But we gotta do something!

01:35:05.470 --> 01:35:08.870
Saki, forget the butterfly, we're in a match now!

01:35:12.260 --> 01:35:13.140
Ferris wheel.

01:35:14.990 --> 01:35:16.930
Right! The Ferris wheel!

01:35:17.650 --> 01:35:18.370
I see!

01:35:28.130 --> 01:35:29.060
All right!

01:35:29.620 --> 01:35:31.200
"Operation Mifune", begin!

01:35:31.440 --> 01:35:31.940
Fire!

01:35:41.490 --> 01:35:42.070
We did it!

01:35:42.070 --> 01:35:43.260
Saki is a genius!

01:35:44.460 --> 01:35:45.490
Eh?

01:35:48.660 --> 01:35:50.150
Run!

01:35:53.200 --> 01:35:55.520
Wait, isn't it retarded to run away in a straight line?

01:35:55.740 --> 01:35:56.320
Oh, right!

01:36:00.490 --> 01:36:00.890
What?

01:36:09.780 --> 01:36:10.780
Evasive maneuvers!

01:36:13.460 --> 01:36:14.300
The Tsar tank!?

01:36:14.300 --> 01:36:15.110
Panjandrum!?

01:36:18.310 --> 01:36:19.400
It's here!

01:36:19.400 --> 01:36:20.370
Run!

01:36:27.520 --> 01:36:28.950
Huh? Weird!

01:36:29.200 --> 01:36:30.690
Weird what?

01:36:30.690 --> 01:36:33.170
- Don't do meaningless stuff!
- Get away from it!

01:36:41.240 --> 01:36:43.260
Now! Hurry!

01:36:48.360 --> 01:36:50.180
Commander, what do we do next?

01:36:50.430 --> 01:36:52.360
All enemy tanks are in the park now,

01:36:52.520 --> 01:36:53.800
we'll fight using Plan F.

01:36:53.910 --> 01:36:55.650
We'll be your GPS!

01:36:56.450 --> 01:36:58.440
Our tanks are much more dispersed than the enemy's...

01:36:58.440 --> 01:37:00.620
So please take note of where your allies are!

01:37:00.640 --> 01:37:01.270
Yes!

01:37:02.660 --> 01:37:04.690
Mr. Ferris is about to stop.

01:37:04.900 --> 01:37:06.950
Ferris-senpai, thanks for the help!

01:37:06.950 --> 01:37:07.800
Bye bye, Ferry-chan!

01:37:07.800 --> 01:37:08.400
Take care!

01:37:08.400 --> 01:37:09.280
See you!

01:37:14.190 --> 01:37:17.470
Anyway, what do we do now?

01:37:17.510 --> 01:37:18.740
Be a heavy tank killer!

01:37:18.930 --> 01:37:20.040
I don't think so.

01:37:20.150 --> 01:37:22.500
There must be a better way for us to fight...

01:37:22.570 --> 01:37:23.280
Like what?

01:37:26.180 --> 01:37:27.640
We're close to our destination...

01:37:27.780 --> 01:37:29.020
Activate the thingy!

01:37:29.020 --> 01:37:29.920
We'll head there first!

01:37:29.920 --> 01:37:31.120
Let's change clothes!

01:37:32.640 --> 01:37:33.250
These?

01:37:35.940 --> 01:37:38.540
Hey, now is the time to pull back, Katyusha!

01:37:38.540 --> 01:37:39.940
Don't use my name like that!

01:37:39.940 --> 01:37:40.860
Then, Kat-chan!

01:37:40.860 --> 01:37:41.920
Why are you abbreviating it?

01:37:41.920 --> 01:37:43.890
Okay, Kat-chan, hurry up and pull back!

01:37:43.890 --> 01:37:45.910
Run away if you want to!

01:37:46.180 --> 01:37:47.570
I'm staying here to fight!

01:37:48.000 --> 01:37:49.160
Don't push yourself, Kat-chan.

01:37:49.170 --> 01:37:50.960
We fight together!

01:37:51.470 --> 01:37:53.320
Even though Nonna isn't here...

01:37:53.360 --> 01:37:54.520
We're still here!

01:37:54.520 --> 01:37:56.210
We're a team now, nyaa!

01:37:56.210 --> 01:37:56.960
Yup!

01:37:57.210 --> 01:37:59.300
Ooarai's fate depends on the result of this battle...

01:37:59.580 --> 01:38:01.340
Let every man do his utmost duty!

01:38:01.540 --> 01:38:03.860
Tamada here, I can hardly breathe, my body is giving out...!

01:38:03.860 --> 01:38:06.540
Worry not! We have the strongest supporter with us!

01:38:06.660 --> 01:38:08.780
The real Duck joins the battle!

01:38:15.670 --> 01:38:17.400
We're here!

01:38:17.400 --> 01:38:18.330
All correct!

01:38:18.430 --> 01:38:19.620
Master Arm, on!

01:38:19.710 --> 01:38:20.260
Fire!

01:38:23.080 --> 01:38:24.080
Anzio's tradition...

01:38:24.140 --> 01:38:26.290
"Operation Macaroni Zwei" is a success!

01:38:26.630 --> 01:38:28.050
Okay, to the next spot!

01:38:34.340 --> 01:38:36.200
The cavalry is coming for us!

01:38:40.870 --> 01:38:41.900
Now you've done it!

01:38:41.920 --> 01:38:44.380
- This is supposed to be a team-play, Sodoko...
- Master Arm, on!

01:38:44.640 --> 01:38:45.220
Fire!

01:38:48.420 --> 01:38:49.300
To the next spot!

01:38:50.870 --> 01:38:52.270
We're surrounded, Geronimo!

01:38:52.270 --> 01:38:53.440
What should we do, Geronimo?

01:38:53.440 --> 01:38:54.680
Who is Geronimo!?

01:38:54.720 --> 01:38:56.440
Just drive through the buildings!

01:38:56.470 --> 01:38:58.440
These are just sets, we'll be all right!

01:38:58.690 --> 01:39:00.310
Yes, understood, Geronimo!

01:39:14.880 --> 01:39:15.790
Nekonya!

01:39:15.790 --> 01:39:16.520
Piyotan!

01:39:17.440 --> 01:39:18.660
Momoga!

01:39:54.160 --> 01:39:55.720
"Operation F Quick", go!

01:39:55.880 --> 01:39:57.670
"Operation Swiftness VI", right!

01:39:57.970 --> 01:39:59.270
We're ready!

01:40:02.060 --> 01:40:02.790
Not good!

01:40:08.710 --> 01:40:09.210
Why you—!

01:40:10.000 --> 01:40:11.350
Don't spar with her, just aim!

01:40:13.570 --> 01:40:14.170
Crap!

01:40:14.740 --> 01:40:16.000
Tamada, good job!

01:40:16.130 --> 01:40:17.540
Duck-dono, what next?

01:40:17.690 --> 01:40:18.950
A no-spin serve from the ceiling...

01:40:18.960 --> 01:40:20.920
A double block, then a tight spike!

01:40:21.150 --> 01:40:22.100
Understood!

01:40:28.720 --> 01:40:30.060
Our gun is gonna hit the ground!

01:40:30.170 --> 01:40:31.820
Rotate the turret to prevent damage!

01:40:31.840 --> 01:40:32.360
Okay!

01:40:32.760 --> 01:40:33.590
Go, Fuku-chan!

01:40:33.780 --> 01:40:34.750
Understood!

01:40:35.430 --> 01:40:36.410
Double block!

01:40:37.450 --> 01:40:38.500
Push it with guts!

01:40:38.540 --> 01:40:39.360
Yes!

01:40:39.500 --> 01:40:40.460
How's this?

01:40:40.570 --> 01:40:42.320
I don't think that does anything...

01:40:42.330 --> 01:40:43.990
I am Hosomi, nice to meet you!

01:40:47.450 --> 01:40:48.540
Nice shot!

01:40:50.530 --> 01:40:52.850
The way is too narrow, we can't rotate our turret.

01:40:53.260 --> 01:40:55.860
Just focus on following her, don't lose her!

01:40:56.120 --> 01:40:56.840
Got it!

01:41:02.280 --> 01:41:02.780
Eh?

01:41:06.780 --> 01:41:09.230
Sorry, Captain Rumi! We were knocked out!

01:41:09.840 --> 01:41:12.660
Need reinforcements! One Pershing and Chaffee, each!

01:41:12.980 --> 01:41:14.550
Outnumber and surround her!

01:41:14.660 --> 01:41:17.000
Watch out for ambush by the Hetzer with its low height.

01:41:17.140 --> 01:41:18.150
Focus your fire on the Pz IV!

01:41:28.290 --> 01:41:29.650
Hey! Watch it!

01:41:29.760 --> 01:41:30.780
Ah, sorry!

01:41:31.700 --> 01:41:33.700
It's like they're seeing right through our tactics...

01:41:34.060 --> 01:41:35.320
Is it her instinct?

01:41:35.970 --> 01:41:37.740
We just have to force her into a dead end!

01:41:45.960 --> 01:41:47.010
Yes! Got you!

01:41:56.420 --> 01:41:57.050
But how?

01:41:57.570 --> 01:41:59.480
This is more than instinct...

01:42:01.860 --> 01:42:02.590
It's them!

01:42:03.820 --> 01:42:05.540
The enemy team is just like you...

01:42:05.940 --> 01:42:08.300
Getting back up no matter how badly they're beaten...

01:42:09.000 --> 01:42:10.890
Although they're not very strong, they aren't giving up.

01:42:11.160 --> 01:42:13.160
I didn't think high schoolers could do this...

01:42:13.180 --> 01:42:14.640
They keep pulling little tricks! I can't stand them!

01:42:14.850 --> 01:42:15.430
What do we do, then?

01:42:15.180 --> 01:42:16.910
If we complain to the Commander, it would seem...

01:42:17.020 --> 01:42:18.910
But we shouldn't just think of ourselves...!

01:42:18.960 --> 01:42:20.880
<b><i>I'll fight, I'll fight</i></b>

01:42:20.940 --> 01:42:22.680
<b><i>I'll fight for sure</i></b>

01:42:22.980 --> 01:42:26.530
<b><i>Watch me beat up those jerks</i></b>

01:42:26.930 --> 01:42:30.650
<b><i>I'll fight, it's the right thing to do</i></b>

01:42:31.040 --> 01:42:33.010
<b><i>I'll do it with a high spirit</i></b>

01:42:33.080 --> 01:42:34.390
<b><i>I'll do it resolutely</i></b>

01:42:33.230 --> 01:42:34.380
The Commander is singing!

01:42:34.520 --> 01:42:35.410
That means...

01:42:35.560 --> 01:42:36.520
Company, forward!

01:42:36.720 --> 01:42:38.090
The T28 is here!

01:42:38.880 --> 01:42:41.710
That doorway should be too narrow for its body.

01:42:48.140 --> 01:42:48.960
It came off!

01:42:57.100 --> 01:42:58.170
Master Arm, on!

01:42:58.620 --> 01:42:59.340
Not gonna happen.

01:42:59.550 --> 01:43:00.030
Fire!

01:43:00.770 --> 01:43:01.260
Why!?

01:43:01.400 --> 01:43:02.640
It was going so perfectly!

01:43:03.380 --> 01:43:05.200
A Centurion is coming in through the western gate...

01:43:05.520 --> 01:43:06.200
Be careful!

01:43:06.380 --> 01:43:07.270
Got it.

01:43:09.990 --> 01:43:11.650
Crap! We're spotted!

01:43:11.890 --> 01:43:13.540
It looks pretty scary!

01:43:13.950 --> 01:43:14.900
Calm down!

01:43:15.160 --> 01:43:17.030
The tracks up ahead are narrow, they can't catch us!

01:43:27.590 --> 01:43:29.780
I don't care anymore! Run away as fast as you can!

01:43:29.860 --> 01:43:31.490
It's really scary!

01:43:31.550 --> 01:43:33.330
And then we turn around and fight it!

01:43:33.410 --> 01:43:34.180
Can't do it!

01:43:35.390 --> 01:43:37.020
Here we go! Tanks forward!

01:43:37.380 --> 01:43:38.560
It's like the ambush at Hiyodorigoe!

01:43:41.810 --> 01:43:42.950
Fire!

01:43:53.540 --> 01:43:54.300
Ouch!

01:43:54.410 --> 01:43:55.360
- Now...!
- Yes!

01:43:56.660 --> 01:43:58.160
- I'm so sorry!
- Don't mind!

01:44:00.500 --> 01:44:02.340
GUTS!

01:44:08.420 --> 01:44:11.040
We got slaughtered, as usual...

01:44:11.250 --> 01:44:12.590
They may be our foe, but they did a good job!

01:44:12.290 --> 01:44:13.870
Don't be so cheerful!

01:44:14.260 --> 01:44:17.040
According to the data, its weak spot is right there...

01:44:17.380 --> 01:44:19.810
This isn't going to be an elegant victory.

01:44:20.000 --> 01:44:21.990
We came here for Miho's victory...

01:44:22.320 --> 01:44:23.750
Not for our own.

01:44:24.040 --> 01:44:25.990
17 pounder-san, ready?

01:44:26.460 --> 01:44:28.200
Since forever, I'm opening fire.

01:44:28.200 --> 01:44:28.630
If you may.

01:44:38.650 --> 01:44:42.150
We did it. Assam's doctrine on data-gathering is quite handy sometimes.

01:44:42.290 --> 01:44:44.950
But according to the data, our survivability after this is...

01:44:45.400 --> 01:44:46.620
Miho-san, good luck.

01:44:47.130 --> 01:44:49.480
"The final five minutes will decide everything".

01:44:51.550 --> 01:44:53.390
I don't like fighting like a guerrilla...

01:44:53.620 --> 01:44:54.420
Let's regroup.

01:44:54.510 --> 01:44:55.420
We'll use our usual...

01:44:55.460 --> 01:44:56.450
"Bermuda Attack"!

01:45:11.520 --> 01:45:13.100
What a pest!

01:45:13.150 --> 01:45:14.140
We're getting into an infinite loop...

01:45:14.390 --> 01:45:15.320
Duce, up ahead!

01:45:17.460 --> 01:45:18.430
We're getting it from both ends!

01:45:18.490 --> 01:45:18.940
What do we do!?

01:45:19.060 --> 01:45:20.160
No matter, just fire!

01:45:20.180 --> 01:45:20.530
Yes!

01:45:23.640 --> 01:45:24.480
Nice!

01:45:24.720 --> 01:45:25.980
Next!

01:45:27.410 --> 01:45:27.790
Fire!

01:45:29.950 --> 01:45:31.830
As expected from the the light tank killer!

01:45:33.920 --> 01:45:35.940
Eh? What? What's going on?

01:45:35.950 --> 01:45:37.420
- No idea
- A land mine?

01:45:37.420 --> 01:45:39.010
No, we got hit by the enemy!

01:45:39.610 --> 01:45:40.950
The Centurion drove past us!

01:45:41.310 --> 01:45:43.760
Get them all, then we meet up with our Commander.

01:45:44.060 --> 01:45:44.850
Stop there!

01:45:45.730 --> 01:45:46.210
Fire!

01:45:49.190 --> 01:45:51.200
Bastard!

01:45:58.260 --> 01:45:58.640
Eh?

01:46:05.000 --> 01:46:05.910
Oops...

01:46:10.090 --> 01:46:11.910
We're done for!

01:46:12.150 --> 01:46:13.140
Here comes Momo!

01:46:13.500 --> 01:46:14.970
It's over, Momo!

01:46:21.000 --> 01:46:23.130
I'm removing the speed limiter!

01:46:23.700 --> 01:46:25.200
Head to the central plaza.

01:46:25.570 --> 01:46:26.030
Got it!

01:46:26.340 --> 01:46:28.500
Big sis, let's attack together!

01:46:28.660 --> 01:46:29.100
Understood!

01:46:29.360 --> 01:46:31.310
- Hey, Taxi!
- Here!

01:46:32.670 --> 01:46:36.060
I don't care if you ram them, just stop them from regrouping with the Centurion!

01:46:38.570 --> 01:46:39.600
Damn!

01:46:52.390 --> 01:46:53.730
A wild Pershing appeared!

01:46:53.960 --> 01:46:55.560
Is it mopping up the rear?

01:46:55.700 --> 01:46:56.530
Trying to outsmart us!

01:46:56.630 --> 01:46:58.120
Block its way from both ends!

01:46:58.120 --> 01:46:58.690
Got it!

01:46:58.970 --> 01:47:00.530
Is it all right to make such an impulsive decision?

01:47:00.680 --> 01:47:02.390
This seems to be against the rules...

01:47:02.620 --> 01:47:04.560
Rules are made to be broken!

01:47:05.860 --> 01:47:08.460
We can't catch up with them this way, so we'll add more power!

01:47:08.560 --> 01:47:09.830
Slip behind us!

01:47:09.990 --> 01:47:10.570
Please!

01:47:10.670 --> 01:47:11.900
They're slipping?

01:47:12.200 --> 01:47:13.360
It's "slipstream"!

01:47:16.330 --> 01:47:17.920
You— huh?

01:47:19.330 --> 01:47:20.750
We're in your blind spot now!

01:47:21.030 --> 01:47:22.870
Crush this tankette!

01:47:26.670 --> 01:47:28.960
Okay, "Operation T-Square"!

01:47:29.200 --> 01:47:31.540
This has never worked!

01:47:32.860 --> 01:47:33.600
Stop!

01:47:37.500 --> 01:47:39.400
Don't worry, it's shallow.

01:47:39.690 --> 01:47:41.030
Yes! We did it!

01:47:41.160 --> 01:47:42.380
Tankettes are the best!

01:47:48.730 --> 01:47:52.050
You will never catch up with us, you snails.

01:47:54.050 --> 01:47:55.400
There are Federation regulations about the engine...

01:47:55.670 --> 01:47:57.310
But nobody said anything about the motor!

01:48:06.260 --> 01:48:08.240
Go, Supersonic Prince!

01:51:27.920 --> 01:51:28.240
Yes!

01:51:28.470 --> 01:51:29.220
Got it!

01:51:29.480 --> 01:51:30.420
Is it all right?

01:51:30.730 --> 01:51:31.700
Mako-san, please!

01:51:32.100 --> 01:51:32.570
Okay.

01:52:19.540 --> 01:52:20.230
Forward!

01:52:59.610 --> 01:53:00.360
A blank?

01:53:13.100 --> 01:53:15.420
Centurion, Pz IV, knocked out!

01:53:17.530 --> 01:53:18.860
Confirming number of tanks remaining...

01:53:32.650 --> 01:53:33.950
Visual confirmation, complete!

01:53:34.440 --> 01:53:36.970
Unviersity Strengthening Team, none!

01:53:37.600 --> 01:53:40.410
Ooarai Girls High School, one remaining!

01:53:41.760 --> 01:53:43.410
A victory for Ooarai Girls High School!

01:53:43.500 --> 01:53:46.770
Yes! Miss!

01:53:46.930 --> 01:53:48.400
Eh, what? We won?

01:53:48.410 --> 01:53:49.940
Horosho, Pirozhki!

01:53:52.550 --> 01:53:54.020
Banzai!

01:53:54.160 --> 01:53:55.460
Yeah!

01:53:56.960 --> 01:53:57.670
Victory!

01:53:56.960 --> 01:53:57.670
Победа!
Pobeda!

01:53:57.670 --> 01:53:58.460
Well done!

01:53:57.670 --> 01:53:58.460
Молодцы!
Molodtsy

01:54:03.260 --> 01:54:04.940
Now the school isn't gonna close down!

01:54:27.010 --> 01:54:30.960
- Nishizumi-chan!
- Thank you! 
- Won! We won!

01:54:33.010 --> 01:54:35.030
Commander, thank you for your hard work.

01:54:36.070 --> 01:54:37.260
Miho-san, congratulations.

01:54:37.540 --> 01:54:38.380
Congratulations!

01:54:38.400 --> 01:54:39.020
Congratulations!

01:54:39.170 --> 01:54:40.260
It was a good match!

01:54:40.470 --> 01:54:42.970
Everyone, thank you!

01:54:43.750 --> 01:54:45.350
Thank you!

01:54:45.570 --> 01:54:47.760
We have to thank you as well!

01:55:12.350 --> 01:55:13.990
I award you this medal.

01:55:15.380 --> 01:55:17.660
Thank you! I will treasure it!

01:55:23.990 --> 01:55:27.560
A rematch would be fun, with no stakes this time.

01:55:27.980 --> 01:55:28.800
Agreed.

01:55:29.260 --> 01:55:33.450
Senshado really is the essence of every important lesson in life!

01:55:35.180 --> 01:55:35.700
Isn't it?

01:56:18.000 --> 01:56:20.740
<b><i>Just close your eyes</i>
</b>

01:56:20.740 --> 01:56:25.140
<b><i>Listen carefully, and you'll hear</i></b>

01:56:25.920 --> 01:56:31.280
<b><i>That naive voice echoing in your ears</i></b>

01:56:32.480 --> 01:56:34.980
<b><i>Innocently</i></b>

01:56:35.260 --> 01:56:39.740
<b><i>We would have long chats</i></b>

01:56:40.460 --> 01:56:45.240
<b><i>Intertwined with lots of jokes</i></b>

01:56:46.420 --> 01:56:50.240
<b><i>The corridors sprinkled with sunlight</i></b>

01:56:50.700 --> 01:56:53.680
<b><i>The crisp voice of the school chime</i></b>

01:56:53.900 --> 01:56:56.960
<b><i>Ambiguously yet surely</i></b>

01:56:56.960 --> 01:57:00.220
<b><i>Connect the days we had spent together</i></b>

01:57:00.280 --> 01:57:03.340
<b><i>These are precious puzzle pieces</i></b>

01:57:03.460 --> 01:57:07.300
<b><i>You and me back then</i></b>

01:57:07.300 --> 01:57:11.280
<b><i>Didn't need a map of our futures</i></b>

01:57:11.560 --> 01:57:14.880
<b><i>We were always looking for</i></b>

01:57:14.880 --> 01:57:17.580
<b><i>New possibilities</i></b>

01:57:17.960 --> 01:57:21.960
<b><i>Those little dreams we chased</i></b>

01:57:21.960 --> 01:57:25.800
<b><i>Those little bits of tenderness we unknowingly invoked</i></b>

01:57:25.940 --> 01:57:29.440
<b><i>Every bit of them...</i></b>

01:57:29.640 --> 01:57:30.640
<b><i>See?</i></b>

01:57:30.760 --> 01:57:36.680
<b><i>It's what our "present" is made of</i></b>

01:57:48.860 --> 01:57:51.540
<b><i>I forgot how many times</i></b>

01:57:51.580 --> 01:57:56.060
<b><i>The seasons have changed</i></b>

01:57:56.860 --> 01:58:02.340
<b><i>I had to stop to realize it</i></b>

01:58:03.400 --> 01:58:06.000
<b><i>That ahead of us</i></b>

01:58:06.080 --> 01:58:10.640
<b><i>Are paths of different colors</i></b>

01:58:11.300 --> 01:58:16.160
<b><i>Leading to so many destinations</i></b>

01:58:17.380 --> 01:58:21.420
<b><i>Those bookmarks stuck in the books</i></b>

01:58:21.620 --> 01:58:24.640
<b><i>Those flowers in the courtyard</i></b>

01:58:24.780 --> 01:58:27.840
<b><i>Fluttering in the wind</i></b>

01:58:27.980 --> 01:58:31.140
<b><i>As if in a dance</i></b>

01:58:31.200 --> 01:58:34.160
<b><i>Every time we head home from school</i></b>

01:58:34.360 --> 01:58:42.180
<b><i>You and me back then</i></b>

01:59:03.320 --> 01:59:07.340
<b><i>You and me back then</i></b>

01:59:07.340 --> 01:59:11.400
<b><i>Didn't need a map of our futures</i></b>

01:59:11.400 --> 01:59:14.840
<b><i>We were always looking for</i></b>

01:59:14.840 --> 01:59:17.620
<b><i>New possibilities</i></b>

01:59:18.020 --> 01:59:21.920
<b><i>That friendship that didn't change</i></b>

01:59:21.920 --> 01:59:25.760
<b><i>Those promises we didn't manage to fulfill</i></b>

01:59:25.860 --> 01:59:29.420
<b><i>Every bit of them...</i></b>

01:59:29.560 --> 01:59:30.580
<b><i>See?</i></b>

01:59:30.700 --> 01:59:37.100
<b><i>It's what our "future" is made of</i></b>
